{"id": "1655", "revid": "13531", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1655", "title": "Adamu", "text": "\"Iy'ingingo iragaruka kunkuru ndetse no kwishusho rusange rya bibiliya. Kubindi bikoreshwa, Ukeneye ibisobanuro byimbitse ndetse no gusobanukirwa birushijeho, reba Adamu na Eva.\"\nAdamu ni ishusho mu gitabo cy'Itangiriro muri Bibiliya y'Igiheburayo, no muri Korowani no mu myizerere ya gikristo. Dukurikije imigani y'irema [1] y'amadini ya Aburahamu, niwe muntu wa mbere. Mu Itangiriro na Korowani, Adamu n'umugore we birukanwe mu busitani bwa Edeni bazira kurya imbuto z'igiti cy'ubumenyi bw'icyiza n'ikibi.\nUburyo butandukanye bwo kurema no gusobanura Bibiliya buvuga ko Adamu ari umuntu wamateka. Ibimenyetso bya siyansi ntibishyigikira igitekerezo cy'uko abantu bose bakomoka ku muntu umwe. \nIjambo adam rikoreshwa kandi muri Bibiliya nk'izina, umuntu ku giti cye nk '\"umuntu\" kandi mu buryo rusange nk \"abantu\". Adamu wo muri Bibiliya (umuntu, abantu) yaremewe kuva adamah (isi), kandi Itangiriro 1-8 ryerekana uruhare runini rwubucuti hagati yabo, kuko Adamu yatandukanijwe nisi kubwo kutumvira kwe.\nIndanganturo (Reference).\nByahinduwe mu Kinyarwanda https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adam"}
{"id": "1657", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1657", "title": "Ubukirisitu", "text": "Ubukirisitu (cyangwa Ubukirisito, Ubukristu) ni idini ryemera Imana imwe, rishingiye ku buzima no ku nyigisho za Yezu Kirisitu nk'uko zanditswe muri Bibiliya, cyane cyane mu Isezerano Rishya. Abayoboke baryo bitwa Abakirisitu. Ni ryo dini rifite abayoboke benshi ku isi: basaga miliyari 2,3, ni ukuvuga hafi 28,8 % by'abatuye isi. Mu Rwanda, Abakirisitu barenga 90 % by'abaturage.\nInkomoko n'amateka.\nUbukirisitu bwavukiye i Yerusalemu no muri Yudeya mu kinyejana cya mbere, buturutse mu Bayahudi bakurikiye Yezu w'i Nazareti. Abakirisitu bemera ko Yezu yabambwe ku musaraba, agapfa, hanyuma akazuka. Intumwa ze, cyane cyane Mutagatifu Pawulo, zakwirakwije ubutumwa bwiza mu bihugu bikikije inyanja ya Mediterane.\nNyuma y'ibihe by'itotezwa, Ubukirisitu bwemerewe mu Bwami bw'Abaroma mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 4, maze mu mpera z'icyo kinyejana buba idini rya leta. Bwakwiriye mu Burayi, hanyuma mu bihe by'ubukoloni bugera muri Amerika, Afurika no muri Aziya.\nImyemerere n'imihango.\nAbakirisitu benshi bemera Imana imwe mu Butatu Butagatifu: Imana Data, Imana Mwana (Yezu Kirisitu) na Roho mutagatifu. Bemera ko Yezu ari Umwana w'Imana na Mesiya (Kirisitu) wahanuwe mu Isezerano rya Kera. Iminsi mikuru ikomeye ni Pasika, yibuka izuka rya Yezu, na Noheli, yibuka ivuka rye. Imihango y'ingenzi (amasakaramentu) irimo batisimu n'Ukaristiya.\nAmatorero.\nMu 2020, Abakirisitu bari hafi miliyari 2,3, ni ukuvuga 28,8 % by'abatuye isi. Ubukirisitu bugabanyijemo amatorero menshi. Ayingenzi ni aya:\nUbukirisitu mu Rwanda.\nAbamisiyoneri Gatolika b'Abapadiri Bera bashinze misiyoni ya mbere mu Rwanda mu 1900, mu gihe cy'ubukoloni bw'Ubudage. Abamisiyoneri b'Abaporotesitanti b'Abadage baturutse muri Usambara bageze mu Rwanda mu 1907, bashinga itorero ryaje kwitwa Itorero Peresibiteriyeni mu Rwanda (EPR).\nNk'uko Twagirayesu na Butselaar babyemeza, EPR yashatse kuva ikivuka kugirana imibanire myiza n'andi matorero. Abamisiyoneri bo muri Usambara bagiranye umubano n'Abapadiri Bera, naho Abamisiyoneri b'Ababirigi bakorana na \"Church Missionary Society\" (CMS); kimwe mu bikorwa bahuriyeho ni uguhindura Bibiliya mu Ikinyarwanda. Ubwo bufatanye bw'amatorero y'Abaporotesitanti bwatumye havuka Inama y'Abaporotesitanti mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ry'abaturage ryo mu 2022, abaturage b'u Rwanda bari bagabanyije batya: Abagatolika 40 %, Abapantekoti 21 %, abandi Baporotesitanti 15 %, Abadiventisti 12 % n'abandi Bakirisitu 4 %. Ahantu hazwi cyane h'iyobokamana ni nka Kibeho na Kabgayi."}
{"id": "1663", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1663", "title": "Abatutsi", "text": "Abatutsi ni ubwoko bwabanyafurika bubarizwa mugice cy'uburasirazuba, bukaba bwiganje mu Rwanda no mu Burundi, ariko buboneka no mu bindi bihugu bya Afurika yo hagati nka Uganda, Democratic Republic of Congo na Tanzaniya. \nAbatutsi bivugwa ko aribo baje nyuma mu karere k\u2019ibiyaga bigari. N\u2019aborozi b\u2019inka bakaba ari 21% abatuye u Rwanda n\u2019Uburundi. Bagaragaraga nk\u2019imfura bakaba banashoboye gutegeka akarere igihe kirekire bakanakundwa nabose ariko twebwe Abanyarwanda Ubu ibintu bijyanye namoko ntabihari ubu twese turi abanyarwanda byumwihariko mukarere kacu ka ngororero byu mwihariko urubyiruko rwo muri akarere ka ngororero twahagurukiye kurwanya ingenga bitekerezo Binyuze muri gahunda ya nd' Umunyarwanda\nhttp://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Intore"}
{"id": "1666", "revid": "8075", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1666", "title": "Interahamwe", "text": "Interahamwe wari Umutwe w'urubyiruko rw' abahutu b'abahezanguni bari mu Ishyaka rya MRND mu Rwanda. Mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Interahamwe zishe abatutsi batavugaga rumwe nazo barenga miriyoni, Interahamwe zise abatutsi inyenzi n\u2019inzoka. Bamwe mu bari bagize uyu mutwe baracyihisha mu mashyamba ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo ndetse no mu bindi bihugu bitandukanye ku isi, abandi batashye mu Rwanda baraburanishwa, bamwe barafungwa, abandi basubizwa mu buzima busanzwe."}
{"id": "1779", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1779", "title": "Impunzi z'Abarundi mu Rwanda", "text": "Impunzi z'Abarundi ku Mayaga muri Jenoside.\nImyaka 31 irashize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi ibaye ariko ibikomere byayo biracyavirirana mu mitima y'abagizwe ingaruka nayo, barimo abagishakisha ubutabera ku bayigizemo uruhare bose.\nMu bagifite ibikomere harimo imiryango yabuze abayo mu 1994 mu yahoze ari komine Ntyazo, ubu ni mu Mirenge ya Kibilizi na Muyira mu Karere ka Nyanza, ahazwi nka ku Mayaga.\nJenoside muri aka gace yakoranywe ubukana n'ubugime bukabije, igirwamo uruhare n'Interahamwe zo muri aka gace zitijwe umurindi n'Impunzi z'Abarundi zari zarahungiye ahitwa Ngoma mu Murenge wa Muyira. Kubera umujinya n'urwango bari bavanye iBurundi, ngo impunzi z'Abarundi zicaga urubozo Abatutsi bo ku Mayaga, zibakwena ko zishaka kureba niba bava amaraso cyangwa amata.\nIntandaro, urupfu rwa Ndadaye.\nMu ukuboza 1993, uwari Perezida w'u Burundi Melchoir Ndadaye yishwe bunyamaswa n'igisirikare. Ni we wari Perezida wa mbere watowe n'abaturage mu mateka y'u Burundi. Urupfu rwa Ndadaye rwakurikiwe n'isubirannamo ry'amoko, ryatumye Abahutu benshi bahungira mu Rwanda.\nIbikorwa by'impunzi z'Abarundi mugushyira mubikorwa umugambi wa Jenoside.\nAbarundi bahunganye umujinya, bavuga ko Nadaye yishwe n'Abatutsi bityo nabo ahao bazabonera akanya bazihorera.\nBageze mu Rwanda bagize amahirwe bahasanga umukwabu wo kugirira nabi Abatutsi bo mu Rwanda, nicyo cyatumye bagira ingufu nyinshi ngo bafashe za nterahamwe zo mu Rwanda. Ntabwo bihoreraga ku Batutsi b'ino kuko nta ruhare bagize iwa i Burundi ariko iryo zina Tutsi, kubera ibyabaye i Burundi, bagize bati natwe tubikore hano mu Rwanda.\nUretse muri Ntyazo, impunzi z'Abarundi zari muri Komine Ntongwe n Muganza muri Butare nazo zagize uruhare muri Jenocide yakorewe Abatutsi. Abo bo bavugwaho ubugome bukabije kuko baryaga imitima y'Abatutsi bamaze kwica.\nNubwo hari impunzi z'Abarndi zari zarageze mu Rwanda mu 1993, zaje zihasanga izindi zahageze mu myaka ya 1972 na 1989. Impunzi zari zarahageze mbere zabaye nk'abaturage ku buryo zari zizi aho Abatutsi batuye. Izo nizo zifashishijwe muri Jenoside, zikajya zereka bene wabo aho Abatutsi batuye mu gihe babaga batari kumwe n'Interahamwe.\nIngamba leta y'u Rwanda yafashe mu gukurikirana Impunzi z'Abarundi zagize uruhare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMuri Kanama umwaka wa 2019, Minisitiri w'ubutabera yabwiye Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ko icyaha cya Jenoside kidasaza ko n'amadosiye y'Abarundi bakekwaho uruhare muri ayo mahano mu Rwanda yamaze gukorwa.\nURwanda rwohereje impapuro zo guta muri yombi bamwe mu Barundi bakekwa, icyakora, Leta yagiye igaragaza ko byagiye bigenda biguru ntege kubera ubushake buke bwa Leta y'u Burundi."}
