{"id": "2024", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2024", "title": "Kigali", "text": "Kigali ni umurwa mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda. Kigali iri hagati mu gihugu. Kigali yabaye umurwa mukuru igihe u Rwanda rwabonaga ubwigenge muri 1962.\nUmujyi wa Kigali ni n\u2019urwego rw\u2019ubutegetsi ruri ku rwego rumwe n\u2019intara enye z\u2019u Rwanda. Umujyi wa Kigali ugizwe n\u2019uturere dutatu: Gasabo, Kicukiro na Nyarugenge. Muri 2022, Umujyi wa Kigali wari ufite abaturage 1 745 555.\nImiterere.\nKigali iri hagati mu Rwanda, ku ruzi rwa Ruganwa. Umujyi wubatse ku misozi ine. Umujyi wa Kigali ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 730.\nUbuyobozi.\nUmujyi wa Kigali ni rumwe mu nzego eshanu nini z\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019u Rwanda, hamwe n\u2019intara enye. Umujyi wa Kigali ugizwe n\u2019uturere 3, imirenge 35, utugari 161 n\u2019imidugudu 1 155. Inzego z\u2019ubuyobozi zirimo Inama Njyanama y\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali na Komite Nyobozi.\nAmateka.\nKu butegetsi bw\u2019Abadage, Kigali yari ihuriro ry\u2019ubucuruzi guhera nyuma ya 1895.\nInzu y\u2019umushakashatsi Richard Kandt yubatswe muri 1907. Iyo nzu ifatwa nk\u2019inyubako ya mbere ya Kigali. Ubu ni inzu ndangamurage y\u2019amateka kamere. Muri 2007, Kigali yizihije imyaka 100 imaze ibayeho.\nKigali yabaye umurwa mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda igihe u Rwanda rwabonaga ubwigenge muri 1962.\nMuri 1994, Abatutsi benshi b\u2019i Kigali bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUbwikorezi.\nImihanda ihuza Kigali n\u2019imipaka yose y\u2019u Rwanda. Kigali ifite ikibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga."}
