{"id": "2721", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2721", "title": "Imbwa", "text": "Imbwa yo mu rugo (Canis familiaris iyo ifatwa nk'ubwoko butandukanye cyangwa Canis lupus familiaris iyo ifatwa nk'ubwoko bw'impyisi) ni inyamaswa z\u2019inyamabere zororerwa mu muryango Canidae. Nibice bigize ibisimba bisa nimpyisi, kandi ni inyamanswa nyinshi zo ku isi. Imbwa hamwe nimpyisi yumukara isigaye ni mushiki wa tagisi kuko impyisi ya kijyambere ntaho ihuriye cyane nimpyisi yororerwa bwa mbere, bivuze ko umukurambere wimbwa yazimye. Imbwa niyo bwoko bwa mbere bwororerwa mu rugo, kandi bwororerwa mu myaka ibihumbi n'ibihumbi kubera imyitwarire itandukanye, ubushobozi bwo kumva, n'ibiranga umubiri.\nKuba zimaranye igihe kirekire n'abantu byatumye imbwa zihuza bidasanzwe imyitwarire n'abantu, kandi zirashobora gutera imbere mu mirire ikungahaye kuri krahisi yaba idahagije kubindi binyobwa. Imbwa ziratandukanye cyane muburyo, ubunini, n'amabara. Zikora imirimo myinshi kubantu, nko guhiga, kuragira, gukurura imizigo, kurinda, gufasha abapolisi n'abasirikare, kubana, ndetse, vuba aha, gufasha abamugaye, ninshingano zo kuvura. Izi ngaruka kumuryango wabantu zabahaye sobriquet y \"inshuti magara yumun.=="}
{"id": "2734", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2734", "title": "Facebook", "text": "Facebook \nNyuma y\u2019aho mu minsi ishize abakoresha Facebook batangiye kubona ko ingano y\u2019inyuguti umuntu yanditse cyangwa izo abandi banditse zagabanutse, bamwe bakagira ngo ni ikibazo cy\u2019imashini bakoresha cyangwa browser (Mozilla, Microsoft Edge, 360, Google Chrome) bakoreramo.\nNyuma y\u2019aho ibibajijwe kenshi biciye kuri X rero, Facebook yasohotse itangazo nayo ibicishije kuri X, aho yavuze ko uko kugabanya ingano y\u2019inyuguti (\"font size\") biri mu rwego rwo gukomeza guhindura uburyo iyo site iteye n\u2019ibyo igeza ku bakunzi bayo kugirango serivisi zayo zikomeze kubanogera.\nicyowameny.\nfacebook abanyarwanda bakunze kuyikoresha cyane usanga bafite nababakurikira benshicyane ariko harinurndi rubunga rwaje murwanda rushya urumeza nka facebook tiktok cg x rwitwa apachat"}
{"id": "2735", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2735", "title": "Mitarayeze", "text": "Mitarayeze (\"mitrailleuse\") ni yo yari igezweho mu gihe cy\u2019intambara ya mbere y\u2019isi. Icyo gihe inganda zashyize ingufu mu gucura ibikoresho by\u2019intambara muri rusange, ariko bakaba bari bamaze imyaka 50 bari mu kugerageza niba babigeraho. Guhera mu 1914, ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga byakoreshejwe bidasubirwaho mu nzego nyinshi, cyane cyane izifite aho zihurira n\u2019imirwano.\nInganda zicura ibyuma n\u2019ikoreshwa ry\u2019ubumara byatumye abahanganye ku rugamba bagira ingufu mu kwirinda umwanzi. Ka gerenade (\"grenade\") kari gasigaye ari ako kwitwaza mu kwikiza umwanzi ku buryo butunguranye. \nIgihe iyi ntambara yabaga havumbuwe ibintu byinshi, harimo igisasu kiremereye cyarashwe mu 1915; canons antia\u00e9riens, ni ukuvuga uburyo bwo kuyobya ibisasu n\u2019indege biri mu kirere; kuyobora indege ziri mu kirere; itumanaho hagati y\u2019abari ku rugamba n\u2019abayobozi babo, n\u2019ibindi; ariko nyine ibyo byose bikajyana no gutwara ubuzima bw\u2019abantu. "}
{"id": "2736", "revid": "11347", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2736", "title": "Pariki ya Nyungwe", "text": "Pariki y'Igihugu ya Nyungwe (izwi kandi nka Ishyamba rya Nyungwe) ni pariki y'igihugu n'ishyamba riherereye mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, ku mupaka w'u Burundi, aho ikomereza muri Pariki y'Igihugu ya Kibira.\nIfite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 1 019, ikaba ari ryo shyamba rinini risigaye mu Rwanda. Ni rimwe mu mashyamba y'imvura ya kera kurusha ayandi muri Afurika. Kuva muri Nzeri 2023, iri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nImiterere.\nPariki iherereye mu turere twa Rusizi, Nyamasheke, Nyamagabe na Nyaruguru. Ifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 1 019, ikaba ari ryo shyamba rinini risigaye mu Rwanda. Ihana imbibi n'u Burundi, aho ikomereza muri Pariki y'Igihugu ya Kibira. Ni rimwe mu mashyamba y'imvura ya kera kurusha ayandi muri Afurika. Iri mu karere k'Ubuhanuka bwa Alberitine (\"Albertine Rift\"), ku butumburuke buri hagati ya metero 1 480 na 2 950. Igizwe ahanini n'ishyamba ry'imisozi miremire rivanzemo n'ibishanga, birimo igishanga cya Kamiranzovu kiri ku butumburuke bwo hejuru. Igice cyanditswe ku rutonde rwa UNESCO kigizwe n'ibice bitatu: ishyamba kimeza rya Nyungwe, irya Gisakura n'irya Cyamudongo.\nPariki iri ku murongo ugabanya amazi y'ikibaya cya Kongo mu burengerazuba n'icya Nili mu burasirazuba. Itanga hafi 70% by'amazi y'u Rwanda.\nUrusobe rw'ibinyabuzima.\nNyungwe ni kimwe mu bice by'ingenzi muri Afurika mu kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima:\nAmateka.\nIshyamba rya Nyungwe ryarinzwe ku mugaragaro guhera mu 1933, ubwo ubutegetsi bw'abakoloni b'Ababiligi bwarigize ishyamba ririnzwe (\"forest reserve\"). Amategeko yabuzaga gutema ishyamba hagamijwe ubuhinzi, ariko yemereraga abaturage gutashya inkwi. Kubera ko atubahirizwaga uko bikwiye, abaturage bakomeje kurihigamo, guhakura ubuki, gutema ibiti, kurihingamo no gucukuramo zahabu.\nMu 2005, ishyamba rya Nyungwe ryagizwe pariki y'igihugu. Mu Ukwakira 2020, Ikigo gishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda (RDB) n'umuryango African Parks basinye amasezerano y'imyaka 20 yo gufatanya gucunga pariki. Ubu icungwa na sosiyete \"Nyungwe Management Company\", ku bufatanye bwa Leta y'u Rwanda na African Parks. Muri Nzeri 2023, Nyungwe yashyizwe ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO, hashingiwe ku rusobe rw'ibinyabuzima byayo (igipimo cya x).\nUbukerarugendo n'abaturage.\nNyungwe ni kimwe mu byerekezo by'ingenzi by'ubukerarugendo mu Rwanda: abasura pariki bashobora gukurikirana impundu n'izindi nkende, kureba inyoni no gutembera mu nzira z'ishyamba. Pariki ifite kandi \"zipline\" ya metero 1 935, imwe mu ndende muri Afurika. Mu 2025, pariki yari iteganya kwinjiza amafaranga y'u Rwanda agera kuri miliyari 4,8.\nAbaturage barenga 1 600 baturiye pariki bakora imirimo ibyara inyungu binyuze mu makoperative, bikagirira akamaro abagize ingo barenga 6 800. Bamwe mu bahoze ari ba rushimusi babaye abarinzi b'ishyamba bakuraho imitego kandi basubiranya ishyamba."}
{"id": "2737", "revid": "10902", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2737", "title": "Icyondi", "text": "Icyondi (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Cercopithecus lhoesti\")\nNyungwe ni hamwe mu hantu hake ku isi hakiboneka ubu bwoko bw\u2019inguge, ushobora kuzisanga hafi y\u2019umuhanda ahegereye Uwinka."}
{"id": "2739", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2739", "title": "Inkomo", "text": "Inkomo (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Colobus angolensis\")\nIshyamba rya Nyungwe niryo ryonyine ku mugabane w\u2019Afurika ribonekamo izi nguge mu matsinda manini, agizwe n\u2019inguge 350."}
{"id": "2742", "revid": "10902", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2742", "title": "Igihinyage", "text": "Igihinyage (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Cercopithecus hamlyni\"): Iyi nguge ihunga abantu ntipfa kuboneka. Iboneka muri Kongo yo haagti, mu burasirazuba bwo muri Repubulika Iharanira demokarasi ya Congo, u Rwanda n\u2019Uburundi."}
{"id": "2743", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2743", "title": "Inkima", "text": "Inkima (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Cercopithecus mitis doggetti\" &amp; \"kandti\")\nN\u2019ubwo ziboneka mu matsinda hamwe zitwa kandi \"Monas\", zimwe ziboneka ziri kumwe n\u2019izindi nk\u2019Inkomo, Inyenzi cyangwa Ibishabaga."}
{"id": "2746", "revid": "11850", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2746", "title": "Inyenzi", "text": "Inyenzi (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini ?): Izi nguge zibera mu biti ziboneka mu bice by\u2019Uwinka."}
{"id": "2747", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2747", "title": "Impundu", "text": "Impundu ni inyamaswa nini iri mu bwoko bw'inkende nini. Impundu kandi ifitanye isano ya hafi n'umuntu kubera ko zifite 98,6% by'uturemangingo tw'umuntu.\nNiyo nguge nini iba muri Nyungwe. Habonekamo izigera kuri 500, Umugide (cyangwa uyobora ba mukerarugendo), ashobora kugufasha kuzimenya n\u2019ibiziranga."}
{"id": "2751", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2751", "title": "Umuko", "text": "Umuko cyangwa Umurinzi (izina mu kilatini \"Erythrina abyssinica\") ni ikimera.\nIki giti ngo kimaze imyaka myinshi cyane muri Pariki ya Nyungwe, ndetse kandi gikungahaye ku buvuzi butangaje kuko kibasha kuvura indwara zitandukanye zirimo; Imitezi, Ubushye, Kuribwa mu ngingo, Ibikomere, Ibisebe, Mburugu n\u2019Uburwayi bwo mu ngingo. "}
{"id": "2753", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2753", "title": "Umuturirwa", "text": "Umuturirwa (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Zanthoxylum gilletti, Fagara macrophylla\")\nIki giti mureba hano nacyo kiboneka muri iyi Pariki ya Nyungwe gikungahaye mu kuvura indwara zitandukanye zirimo; Ibicurane, Maraliya, Igituntu, Ibibyimba, n\u2019Uburwayi bw\u2019amenyo. "}
{"id": "2756", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2756", "title": "Isununu", "text": "Isununu (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Crassocephalum vitellium\") ni ikimera.\nNkurikije uko nabonye iki giti n\u2019ukuntu nabonye gikungahaye ku buvuzi cyane cyane mu bibazo bikunze gusenya ingo, reka nsabe abagabo batandukanye bazanyarukire yo maze bihere ijisho wenda hari icyo byabamarira. Iki giti ngo kivura cyangwa kigabanya umuvuduko w\u2019amaraso mu mubiri, ariko cyane cyane ngo mu kuvura ubugumba bw\u2019abagabo kirebaho, mbese ngo iyo umugabo agikoresheje yari ingumba; Ikibazo cye gisigara ari amateka. \nNotes.\nHari kandi n`isununu z`uburwayi umuntu arwara nko ku ntoki kw'isura,kubirenge n`ahandi hose k`umubiri. "}
{"id": "2758", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2758", "title": "Umugote", "text": "Umugote (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini: \"Syzygium guineese\")\nIki giti nacyo ngo ni ubukombe muri Parike itagira uko isa ya Nyungwe, kivura indwara ebyiri arizo Amibe ndetse n\u2019amarozi. "}
{"id": "2760", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2760", "title": "Umusengesi", "text": "Umusengesi (izina mu kilatini \"Myrcia sphaerocarpa, Myrcia salicifolia\")\nUmusengesi nacyo ni ikindi giti gifite akamaro kigaragara muri Pariki ya Nyungwe, iki giti kandi kivura amarozi yo mu bwoko butandukanye, kandi ngo kuri ba bandi igifu cyabujije amahwemo babonye umuti wacyo hehe no kongera ku kirwara. "}
{"id": "2763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2763", "title": "Umwumba", "text": "Umwumba (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Prunus africana\") ni igiti n\u2019urubuto. \nIki giti ni umwe mu miti ikomeye cyane ihagaragara muri iyi Pariki kuko kivura indwara zitandukanye zirimo Umuriro, Igifu, Kanseri ya Prostate, Inkorora ndetse na Diyabete. "}
{"id": "2765", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2765", "title": "Imvuvumu", "text": "Imvuvumu (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini: \"Ficus natalensis\")\nUmuti ukomoka kuri iki giti ni ingenzi cyane kuko ngo uwawunyoye atandukana n\u2019indwara zimwe na zimwe zigize akaraha kajyahe zirimo Ibicurane, Inkorora, Ibisebe ndetse kandi ngo kuri ba bantu banyara ku buriri kuva bafite ukwezi kumwe kugeza ku myaka isaga mirongo itatu, iyo banyweye ku muti ugikomokaho biba birangiye, hehe no kongera kunyara ku buriri. "}
{"id": "2769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2769", "title": "Lotusi y\u2019ubuhinde", "text": "Lotusi y\u2019ubuhinde (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Citrus reticulata\") ni igiti cyiza kiba mu mazi, kikagira amababi y\u2019icyatsi areremba hejuru y\u2019amazi. Indabo z\u2019ikigina ziboneka ku nti nazo ziri hejuru y\u2019amazi.\nUrurabo rwa Lotusi y\u2019ubuhinde rufatwa nk\u2019ikintu gitagatifu n\u2019abanyedini rya Buda mu misengere yabo. Igiti cyose kiribwa n\u2019abantu, bigatuma kenshi intete n\u2019imizi (inguli) zakoreshejwe mu mitekere yak era muri aziya y\u2019amajyepfo y\u2019uburasirazuba. Lotusi y\u2019ubuhinde ni igiti cyahingwa ahantu hose kimwe no guhinga lili y\u2019amazi ihumura. Ntibikomeye gutera iki gihingwa mu bihe byacu, ugomba gusa kumenya uko ubikora. "}
{"id": "2772", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2772", "title": "Amahwa ya Kasi", "text": "Amahwa ya Kasi (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Pinus kesiya\") ni igiti gikura vuba cyo muri Aziya, kitajya kiboneka hanze y\u2019aho gihinze. Ibiti bigira uburebure buri hagati ya metero 30 na 35 n\u2019igihimba gishobora kugera kuri metero 1 y\u2019umubyimba. Buri shami rigira amahwa atatu, rimwe rimwe rifite hafi ya santimetero 15 na 20 z\u2019uburebure. Imbuto z\u2019ibi biti (mu ishusho ry\u2019umutemeri) zigira uburebure buri hagati ya santimetero 5 kugera ku 9 noneho intete zikagira hagati ya santimetero 1,5 kugera kuri 2,5.\nInkomoko y\u2019amahwa ya Kasi ni mu karere ka Himalaya: uhereye mu majyaruguru y\u2019uburasirazuba bw\u2019ubuhinde (muri iki gihe hakurwa imbaho gusa mu misozi ya Kasi na naga, muri leta ya Megalayi na Manipuru), mu Bushinwa (Mu ntara ya Yunani), Buruma (Miyanimari), amajyaruguru ya Tayilani, Lawosi, Viyetinamu (Layi Cawu, Langi soni, Cawo Bangi, Kuwangi Ninihi) no muri Filipine (Luzoni). Amahwa yo muri Filipine aboneka mu bwoko bwa \"Pinus insularis\". Mu Bushinwa haboneka ubundi bwoko bwitwa amahwa ya Yunani (\"Pinus yunanensis\"). "}
{"id": "2774", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2774", "title": "Umwembe wa Kalimantana", "text": "Umwembe wa Kalimantana (izina mu kilatini \"Mangifera casturi\") cyangwa uzwi aho ukomoka ku izina rya Kasturi ni igiti cy\u2019imbuto kiboneka mu karere gashyuha kandi gahehereye kigira hagati ya metero 10 na 30 z\u2019uburebure kikaba ari karande muturere dukeya cyane twegereye Banjarimasini ho mu Majyepfo ya Indoneziya. Kuri ubu zigenda zicika mubiti byishyamba bitewe no gutemwa kw\u2019ibiti kutubahirije amatregeko. Nyamara kiracyaterwa kenshi muri iki gice, kubera impumuro nziza y\u2019imbuto zacyo."}
{"id": "2776", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2776", "title": "Ingagi", "text": "Ingagi (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Gorilla\") \nKwiga iby\u2019inguge ni ugusesengura ubuzima bw\u2019inguge. Iri ni ishami ry\u2019ibinyabuzima rikaba rifitanye isano rya bugufi n\u2019ibijyanye no kwiga imiterere y\u2019ikiremwa-muntu. Ubu ni ubumenyi bw\u2019inguge ku muntu w\u2019iki gihe (\"genus Homo\") cyane cyane umuntu wo mu gihe tugezemo (\"Homo sapiens\"). Ubwo bumenyi bubumbira hamwe kwiga ibisamuntu, birimo abakurambere ba muntu hamwe n\u2019ubundi bwoko bw\u2019inguge zo muri Afurika. Ubumenyi bwo kwiga inguge bugezweho ni ubuhanga buhambaye. Ubwo bumenyi buhera ku kwiga imiterere y\u2019abakurambere b\u2019inguge hamwe, aho zikunze kwibera, ibijyanye n\u2019imitekerereze yazo n\u2019imivugire yazo. Ibi byafashije cyane mu kurushaho ku kumenya ibanze ry\u2019imyifatire y\u2019umuntu n\u2019ibijyanye n\u2019iyo myifatire ku bakurambere ba muntu. \nAmoko menshi y\u2019 inguge hari byinshi ahuriyeho n\u2019 abantu ariko ingagi zo ni akarusho! Ibirenge n\u2019intoki byazo biteye nk\u2019iby'abantu kurusha ubundi bwoko bwose bw\u2019inguge; ingagi zimara igihe kinini ku butaka kurusha izindi nguge zose, niyo mpamvu ibirenge byazo bishobora kugenda nta kibazo. Ibi ubibonera cyane ku ngagi zo mu birunga.\nIBINJYANYE N'INGAGI\ufffc\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/ubukerarugendo/inyamaswa/article/ubushakashatsi-bwagaragaje-imibereho-itangaje-y-ingagi-z-imfubyi\nAbaturage.\nUmubare munini w\u2019izo ngagi uba mu gace k\u2019Afurika yo hagati mu karere k\u2019ibirunga byo mu Rwanda, Repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya Kongo na Uganda. Abayobozi b\u2019ibi bihugu bafatanije n\u2019imiryango iharanira gusigasira urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima bakaba barakoze ibarura ryasanze muri 2011 hazaba hari ingagi zigera kuri 480 mu gihe muri 2003 zanganaga na 380. Iyi mibare ikaba ituma ku isi yose ubu habarirwa ingagi zigera kuri 786. Uyu mubare nk\u2019uko ubuyobozi bw\u2019i\u2019bihugu bibamo ingagi bubivuga ukaba wariyongereye bitewe n\u2019ingamba zafashwe zo kurwanya abahiga inyamaswa. Ibi bikiyongera no ku kurwanya itwika ry\u2019amashyamba. "}
{"id": "2778", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2778", "title": "Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga", "text": "Pariki y'Igihugu y'Ibirunga (izwi kandi nka Pariki y'Ibirunga cyangwa Pariki Nasiyonali y'Ibirunga) ni pariki y'igihugu iherereye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, ku mupaka wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo n'Ubugande. Irinda igice cy'u Rwanda cy'urunigi rw'ibirunga rwa Virunga, harimo ibirunga bitanu: Karisimbi, Bisoke, Sabyinyo, Gahinga na Muhabura.\nYashinzwe mu 1925, ikaba imwe muri pariki za mbere zashinzwe muri Afurika. Izwi ku isi hose kubera ingagi zo mu misozi, ari na zo zituma isurwa cyane, ndetse no kubera umushakashatsi Dian Fossey wahakoreye ubushakashatsi ku ngagi.\nImiterere.\nPariki irinda imisozi ihanamye y'urunigi rwa Virunga. Yitiriwe ibirunga bitanu bitakiruka: Karisimbi (m 4 507, ari cyo kirekire), Bisoke (gifite ikiyaga mu rwobo rwacyo), Sabyinyo, Gahinga na Muhabura. Ibidukikije byayo birimo ishyamba ry'imisozi miremire, imigano, ibyatsi n'ibishanga.\nIbimera bitandukana bitewe n'ubutumburuke. Hagati ya metero 2 400 na 2 500 hari ishyamba ry'ubwoko bwa \"Neoboutonia\"; hagati ya metero 2 500 na 3 200 hari ishyamba ry'imigano (\"Arundinaria alpina\") riri ku buso bungana na 30% bya pariki. Hagati ya metero 2 600 na 3 600 hari ishyamba rya \"Hagenia\" na \"Hypericum\", naho hagati ya metero 3 500 na 4 200 hagaragara cyane ibimera nka \"Lobelia wollastonii\" na \"Senecio erici-rosenii\". Hejuru ya metero 4 300, ibyatsi ni byo byiganje.\nAmateka.\nPariki yashinzwe mu 1925, ari agace gato kari hagati y'ibirunga bya Karisimbi, Bisoke na Mikeno, hagamijwe kurinda ingagi ba rushimusi. Mu 1929 yaraguwe igera ku butaka bw'u Rwanda n'ubwa Kongo y'Ababiligi (ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo), ihinduka Pariki ya Albert (\"Parc Albert\") ifite kilometero kare 8 090, yacungwaga n'abakoloni b'Ababiligi. Nyuma y'ubwigenge bwa Kongo (1960) n'ubw'u Rwanda (1962), pariki yagabanyijwemo ibice bibiri, buri gihugu gicunga igice cyacyo. Ku ruhande rw'u Rwanda, ubuso bwayo bwagiye bugabanuka kubera abaturage bashakaga aho gutura no guhinga.\nUbushakashatsi ku ngagi.\nMu 1902, umusirikare w'Umudage Robert von Beringe yarashe ingagi muri ibi birunga, yohereza ibice byayo i Berlin; abahanga basanga ari ubwoko bw'ingagi butari buzwi, bwitirirwa izina rye (\"Gorilla beringei\").\nMu 1967, umushakashatsi w'Umunyamerikakazi Dian Fossey yashinze ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi cya Karisoke (\"Karisoke Research Centre\") hagati ya Karisimbi na Bisoke. Yamaze igihe kinini muri pariki, agira uruhare runini mu gutuma ingagi zo mu Rwanda zitabwaho ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Yiciwe iwe mu 1985, ashyingurwa muri pariki hafi y'ikigo yashinze.\nUmutekano muke (1992\u20131999).\nMu gihe cy'intambara hagati y'ingabo z'u Rwanda za kera n'iza FPR-Inkotanyi, mu 1992 icyicaro gikuru cya pariki cyagabweho igitero, bituma ubukerarugendo n'ubushakashatsi bihagarara. Umutekano muke wakomeje kubera abacengezi baturukaga muri Kongo, uhagarara burundu mu 1999.\nUrusobe rw'ibinyabuzima.\nPariki izwi cyane ku ingagi zo mu misozi (\"Gorilla beringei beringei\"), ziri mu kaga ko kuzimira. Hagati ya 1958 na 1980, ubuhigi bwatumye umubare wazo uva kuri 450 ugera kuri 250; ubu muri pariki habarirwa ingagi zirenga 360.\nIbamo kandi inkima (\"Cercopithecus kandti\"), inkende idasanzwe, ndetse n'izindi nyamaswa nk'inzovu, imbogo, impyisi n'impongo. Hari kandi amoko y'inyoni arenga 200.\nUbukerarugendo.\nGusura ingagi ni cyo gikorwa nyamukuru cy'ubukerarugendo muri pariki. Umubare w'abasura ingagi ni ntarengwa kandi uruhushya rugurwa muri RDB; rugura amadolari 200 ku batuye Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, 500 ku banyamahanga batuye mu Rwanda na 1 500 ku bandi banyamahanga. Abasura pariki bashobora kandi gusura inkima, kuzamuka ibirunga no gusura imidugudu iyikikije.\nMu 2019, pariki yinjije amadolari y'Amerika agera kuri miliyoni 26. Kuva mu 2005, 10% by'amafaranga ava mu bukerarugendo agenerwa abaturage baturiye pariki."}
{"id": "2890", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=2890", "title": "Igazeti ya Leta ya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda", "text": "Igazeti ya Leta ya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda (izina mu cyongereza \"Official Gazette of the Republic of Rwanda\" ; izina mu gifaransa \"Journal Officiel de la R\u00e9publique du Rwanda\")\nIgazeti ya Leta ya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda isohoka buri wa mbere w\u2019icyumweru.\nIfatabuguzi.\nAmafaranga y\u2019ifatabuguzi ry\u2019umwaka wose, ayo kugura inomero imwe n\u2019ayo kwandikishamo inyandiko arihirwa mu Kigo cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Imisoro n\u2019Amahoro (RRA); uwishyuye yerekana urupapuro yishyuriyeho kugira ngo serivisi ishinzwe Igazeti ya Leta imukorere icyo yishyuriye. Ifatabuguzi ry\u2019umwaka wose rirangirana n\u2019umwaka wishyuriwe kandi kwishyura bigakorwa mbere y\u2019ukwezi kwa Mutarama k\u2019umwaka ufatirwa ifatabuguzi. Abishyura batinze barakirwa bagahabwa numero zasohotse batarafata ubuguzi, iyo zihari, zaba zarashize ntibagire icyo babaza."}
