{"id": "3024", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3024", "title": "Ikilatini", "text": "Ikilatini (izina mu kilatini \"lingua Lat\u012bna\") ni ururimi rwavugwaga kera zo mu bice by'amajyepfo yo mu Burayi,mu karere ka Latium mu gihugu kigari cya Roma ya kera. Ubu ni mu Butaliyani. Uru rurimi ni rwaje kubyara indimi nyinshi harimo igifaransa, igisipanyola, igitaliyani n'izindi...\nUbu ntirukivugwa uretse ko hari ibitabo byinshi kandi byuzuye ubuhanga byanditswe mu kilatini bikiboneka.\nN'ubwo rutagikoreshwa ariko, hari umwihariko kuri Leta ya Vatikani na Kiliziya Gatolika: nirwo rurimi rwa leta rukoreshwa mu nyandiko mpamo. Ibyo byabaye umuco kuva mu bisekuru byo hambere na n'ubu niko bikimeze biturutse ku mateka ya Kiliziya imaze gushinga imizi mu murwa w'abaromani. Igifaransa nicyo rurimi rwa dipolomasi muri leta ya Vatikani n'ubwo hari ababangukirwa n' igitaliyani.\nNtago ikilatini ari ururimi rwera ku bagatolika nk'uko hari bamwe babigoreka. Ndetse nyuma ya Konsili ya Kabiri ya Vatikani, amasengesho, missa byahinduwe mu ndimi abakirisitu gakondo babasha kuvuga. Bityo na hano iwacu mu Rwanda byinshi byahinduwe mu kinyarwanda."}
{"id": "3026", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3026", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Kivu", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Kivu ni kimwe mu biyaga bigari bya Afurika. Giherereye ku mupaka uhuza Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo n'u Rwanda, mu kibaya cya \"Albertine Rift\", ishami ry'iburengerazuba ry'Ikibaya cya Rift cyo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Amazi yacyo asohokera mu mugezi wa Rusizi, utemba ugana mu majyepfo mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika. Kizwiho by'umwihariko kuba kibitse imyuka myinshi ya metani na dioxyde de carbone mu mazi yacyo maremare.\nAho giherereye.\nIbirometero kare bigera ku 1 370, ni ukuvuga 58 % by'ubuso bw'ikiyaga, biri mu mbibi za Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, hagati y'intara za Kivu y'Amajyaruguru na Kivu y'Amajyepfo. Ku ruhande rw'u Rwanda, uturere dukora ku kiyaga ni Rubavu, Rutsiro, Karongi, Nyamasheke na Rusizi.\nImijyi n'insisiro by'ingenzi biri ku nkombe zacyo ni Bukavu, Kabare, Kalehe, Sake na Goma muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ndetse na Gisenyi, Kibuye na Cyangugu mu Rwanda.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Kivu gifite uburebure bwa kilometero 89 n'ubugari bwa kilometero 48. Imiterere y'inkombe zacyo zikase cyane ituma gupima ubuso bwacyo bigorana; bugereranywa na kilometero kare 2 700, bigatuma kiba ikiyaga cya munani kinini muri Afurika. Ubuso bw'amazi yacyo buri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 460 hejuru y'inyanja. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo ntarengwa bugera kuri metero 480, impuzandengo ikaba metero 240.\nIkiyaga gitereye mu kibaya kigenda gitandukana buhoro buhoro, bigatera ibikorwa by'ibirunga muri ako karere, cyane cyane Ikirunga cya Nyiragongo kiri mu majyaruguru yacyo.\nIbirwa.\nIdjwi, ikirwa kiri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni cyo kirwa kinini kiri mu kiyaga cya Kivu, kikaba kimwe mu birwa binini biri mu biyaga ku isi. Ikiyaga gifite kandi utundi turwa duto twinshi, cyane cyane ku ruhande rw'u Rwanda.\nImyuka iri mu mazi.\nIkiyaga cya Kivu ni ikiyaga cy'amazi meza. Hamwe n'ibiyaga bya Nyos na Monoun muri Kameruni, ni kimwe mu biyaga bitatu bizwi bishobora guturika (\"limnic eruption\"). Amazi yacyo maremare abitse metani (CH\u2084) na dioxyde de carbone (CO\u2082) biturutse ku mikoranire y'amazi n'amasoko ashyushye y'ibirunga. Ingano ya metani ibitswe igereranywa na kilometero kibe 65, naho iya dioxyde de carbone ikaba kilometero kibe 256. Metani ahanini ikorwa na mikorobe zihindura CO\u2082 ituruka ku birunga.\nAbahanga bavuga ko iyo imyuka yaturika, dioxyde de carbone yazamuka hejuru y'amazi ikaba yahitana abantu n'inyamaswa bituye mu kibaya cy'ikiyaga, bagera kuri miliyoni ebyiri. Mu karere, imyuka yica nk'iyo isohoka mu butaka yitwa \"mazuku\", ijambo ry'Igiswahili risobanura \u00abumuyaga mubi\u00bb.\nMu mwaka wa 2002, amahindure y'ikirunga cya Nyiragongo yageze mu kiyaga hafi ya Goma; ubushakashatsi bwakozwe nyuma bwagaragaje ko atahungabanyije cyane imiterere y'amazi. No mu iruka ryo mu 2021, ikiyaga nticyahungabanyijwe. Rimwe na rimwe, amazi y'ikiyaga ahindura ibara, ibintu bikurikiranwa n'abahanga.\nGukuramo metani.\nIkiyaga cya Kivu kibitse metani igera kuri miliyari 55 za metero kibe ku bujyakuzimu bwa metero 300. Kugeza mu 2004, yakurwagamo ku rugero ruto, igakoreshwa mu ruganda rwa Bralirwa i Gisenyi.\nMu 2011, isosiyete ContourGlobal yabonye inkunga yo gutangiza umushinga KivuWatt: urubuga rureremba ku kiyaga ruvoma amazi akungahaye kuri gaze, rugatandukanya metani n'indi myuka, hanyuma metani ikoherezwa ku nkombe kugira ngo itange amashanyarazi. Icyiciro cya mbere, gitanga megawati 26 ku muyoboro w'amashanyarazi w'igihugu, cyatashywe mu 2016. Isosiyete Symbion Power na yo yahawe amasezerano mu 2015 yo gutanga megawati 50 zikomoka kuri metani ya Kivu. Reba kandi: Ingufu za Gaz methani.\nIbinyabuzima n'uburobyi.\nIkiyaga cya Kivu gifite amoko make y'amafi ugereranyije n'ibindi biyaga bigari. Mu mpera z'imyaka ya 1950, isambaza (\"Limnothrissa miodon\") zazanywe ziturutse mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika, none zabaye ishingiro ry'uburobyi bw'ubucuruzi ku kiyaga.\nUbwikorezi n'ubukerarugendo.\nUbwato buhuza imijyi iri ku nkombe z'ikiyaga, haba muri Kongo (Goma\u2013Bukavu) no mu Rwanda. Inkombe za Gisenyi, Kibuye na Cyangugu ni ahantu h'ingenzi h'ubukerarugendo mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "3029", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3029", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Muhazi", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Muhazi ni ikiyaga kirekire kandi gifunganye cyo mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Kiri mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru no mu Mujyi wa Kigali.\nIkiyaga cya Muhazi gikora ku turere dutanu. Amazi yacyo ajya mu mugezi wa Nyabugogo. Abagituriye bakora uburobyi n'ubuhinzi. Ikiyaga gikurura kandi ba mukerarugendo.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Muhazi kiri ku butumburuke bwa m 1 450. Gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 34. Uburebure bwacyo ni km 37. Ubugari bwacyo buringaniye ni m 600. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo bugera kuri m 14.\nIkiyaga cya Muhazi gikora ku turere dutanu: Gasabo, Gicumbi, Gatsibo, Kayonza na Rwamagana. Amazi yacyo asohokera mu mugezi wa Nyabugogo.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Abatutsi benshi baguye mu Kiyaga cya Muhazi. Bahungaga Interahamwe. Abarokotse bo mu Karere ka Rwamagana bavuga ko nibura Abatutsi 10 000 baguye muri iki kiyaga.\nUbukungu.\nIkiyaga cya Muhazi kirimo amoko icyenda y'amafi. Amafi aroberwamo cyane ni \"Oreochromis niloticus\" na \"Clarias gariepinus\". Abaturiye ikiyaga bakora ubuhinzi n'uburobyi.\nIkiyaga cya Muhazi gikurura ba mukerarugendo. Muhazi Beach Resort iri mu Murenge wa Muhazi, mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Ku nkombe y'ikiyaga hari kandi ikibuga cya golf mu Murenge wa Gishari.\nMu 2024, abashakashatsi basanze inzoka ya belariziyoze mu mazi y'ikiyaga. Abaturage basabwe kwirinda iyo ndwara."}
