{"id": "3381", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3381", "title": "Umurenge wa Gitega", "text": "Umurenge wa Gitega ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gitega wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 26 668. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 6. Abaturage bawo bose batuye mu mujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Gitega ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 6:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gitega wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 28 728. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 26 668. Abagabo bari 13 699. Abagore bari 12 969. Abaturage bose bari batuye mu mujyi.\nMu 2022, abaturage 7 152 bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15. Abaturage 19 055 bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64. Abaturage 461 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga."}
{"id": "3385", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3385", "title": "Umurenge wa Mageragere", "text": "Umurenge wa Mageragere ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mageragere wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 59 747. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 7. Muri uyu murenge hari gereza ya Nyarugenge.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Mageragere ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 7:\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Mageragere uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Kigali n\u2019Umurenge wa Nyamirambo. Hakurya y\u2019umugezi wa Nyabarongo, uhana imbibi n\u2019Akarere ka Kamonyi.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mageragere wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 23 407. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 59 747. Abagabo bari 34 038. Abagore bari 25 709. Abaturage 35 230 bari batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 24 517 bari batuye mu cyaro.\nIterambere.\nMu 2018, ikinyamakuru IGIHE cyanditse ko Mageragere yahoze ari agace k\u2019icyaro. Nta mihanda, amazi meza, amashanyarazi n\u2019amashuri byari bihari. Abaturage bavomaga amazi mu mugezi wa Nyabarongo. Nyuma, hubatswe amavomo rusange n\u2019imihanda. Hubatswe kandi amasoko 2 n\u2019ibigo nderabuzima 2.\nGereza ya Nyarugenge iri mu Murenge wa Mageragere. Ishobora kwakira abantu bagera ku 9 000."}
{"id": "3387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3387", "title": "Umurenge wa Kanyinya", "text": "Umurenge wa Kanyinya ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kanyinya wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 31 026. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 3. Muri uyu murenge hari uruganda rutunganya amazi rwa Nzove.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Kanyinya ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kanyinya wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 21 859. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 31 026. Abagabo bari 15 776. Abagore bari 15 250. Abaturage 14 437 bari batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 16 589 bari batuye mu cyaro.\nMu 2022, abaturage 11 640 bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15. Abaturage 18 732 bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64. Abaturage 654 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nUruganda rutunganya amazi rwa Nzove ruri mu Murenge wa Kanyinya. Rwatangiye gukora mu 2009. Rushobora gutunganya metero kibe 80 000 z\u2019amazi ku munsi."}
{"id": "3389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3389", "title": "Umurenge wa Kimisagara", "text": "Umurenge wa Kimisagara ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Kimisagara wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 56 534. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 3. Abaturage bawo bose batuye mu mujyi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Kimisagara ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 3:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Kimisagara wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 46 753. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 56 534. Abagabo bari 28 905. Abagore bari 27 629. Abaturage bose bari batuye mu mujyi."}
{"id": "3391", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3391", "title": "Uturere tw\u2019u Rwanda", "text": "Uturere tw\u2019u Rwanda ni inzego z\u2019ubutegetsi z\u2019u Rwanda ziri munsi y\u2019intara. U Rwanda rufite uturere 30. Uturere 27 turi mu ntara enye. Uturere dutatu turi mu Mujyi wa Kigali.\nUturere twashyizweho n\u2019Itegeko Ngenga ryo ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2005. Akarere kayoborwa na Meya n\u2019Inama Njyanama y\u2019Akarere. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, akarere gafite abaturage benshi ni Gasabo.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nItegeko Ngenga N\u00b0 29/2005 ryo ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2005 rigena inzego z\u2019imitegekere y\u2019u Rwanda. Iri tegeko ryashyizeho uturere 30. Umujyi wa Kigali ufite uturere 3. Intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru ifite uturere 5. Intara y\u2019Amajyepfo ifite uturere 8. Intara y\u2019Iburasirazuba ifite uturere 7. Intara y\u2019Iburengerazuba ifite uturere 7.\nImiyoborere.\nBuri karere gafite Inama Njyanama y\u2019Akarere na Meya. Inama Njyanama ishyiraho ingamba z\u2019iterambere ry\u2019akarere. Inama Njyanama yemeza kandi ingengo y\u2019imari y\u2019akarere. Meya atorerwa manda y\u2019imyaka itanu. Iyo manda ishobora kongerwa rimwe gusa.\nUturere dutatu tw\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali ni Gasabo, Kicukiro na Nyarugenge. Utwo turere ntitufite ubuzimagatozi nk\u2019utundi turere. Abayobozi b\u2019utwo turere bashyirwaho na Leta.\nUrutonde rw\u2019uturere.\nImbonerahamwe ikurikira igaragaza uturere 30 n\u2019umubare w\u2019abaturage babaruwe mu 2012 no mu 2022."}
{"id": "3392", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3392", "title": "Umurenge wa Muhima", "text": "Umurenge wa Muhima ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Muhima wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 22 531. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 7. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 2,92.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Muhima ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y\u2019Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari 7:\nUtwo tugari tugizwe n\u2019imidugudu 39.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Muhima ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 2,92. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Kimisagara, Umurenge wa Gitega n\u2019Umurenge wa Nyarugenge. Uhana imbibi kandi n\u2019umwe mu mirenge y\u2019Akarere ka Gasabo.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2002, Umurenge wa Muhima wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 48 466. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Muhima wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 29 768. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 22 531. Abagabo bari 12 286. Abagore bari 10 245. Abaturage bose bari batuye mu mujyi."}
{"id": "3393", "revid": "9535", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3393", "title": "Akagari k\u2019Amahoro", "text": "Akagari k\u2019Amahoro ni kamwe mu tugari tugize Umurenge wa Muhima, gahana imbibi n\u2019akagari ka kabasengerezi, n' akagali ka rugenge akagali ka Nyabugogo, n\u2019Akarere ka Gasabo.\nAkagari k\u2019Amahoro kagizwe n\u2019imidugudu itandatu ariyo umudugudu w amahoro,umudugudu w AMizero,umudugudu wa Nyarurembo,umudugudu wa Kabilizi,Umudugudu w'uruhimbi n UMudugudu w'Ubuzima... iyoborwa na komite nyobozi y\u2019\u2019Umudugudu igizwe n abantu batanu bakuriwe n\u2019Umukuru wawo."}
{"id": "3397", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3397", "title": "Imirenge y\u2019u Rwanda", "text": "Imirenge (ubumwe: umurenge; mu Gifaransa: \"secteurs\"; mu Icyongereza: \"sectors\") ni inzego z\u2019imiyoborere y\u2019igihugu ziri ku rwego rwa gatatu mu Rwanda, nyuma y\u2019intara n\u2019uturere. U Rwanda rufite imirenge 416 iri mu turere 30.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nBuri karere kagabanyijemo imirenge. Buri murenge ugabanyijemo utugari. Buri kagari kagabanyijemo imidugudu. U Rwanda rufite imirenge 416 iri mu turere 30.\nIyi miterere yashyizweho n\u2019ivugurura ry\u2019inzego z\u2019imitegekere y\u2019igihugu. Iryo vugurura ryatangiye gukurikizwa ku wa 1 Mutarama 2006. Intara 12 zasimbujwe intara 4 n\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali. Izo nzego eshanu zigabanyijemo uturere 30.\nUbuyobozi.\nUmurenge ugira inzego ebyiri: Inama Njyanama y\u2019umurenge n\u2019Ubunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa bw\u2019umurenge. Ubunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa bufite Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa w\u2019umurenge. Umurenge, akagari n\u2019umudugudu nta buzimagatozi bifite.\nAbagize Inama Njyanama y\u2019umurenge ntibatorwa n\u2019abaturage mu buryo butaziguye. Batorwa mu bagize inama njyanama z\u2019utugari.\nUrutonde rw\u2019imirenge.\nUrutonde rukurikira rugaragaza imirenge y\u2019akarere kamwe kamwe, ikurikiranye hakurikijwe inyuguti. Imirenge myinshi ifite amazina amwe iri mu turere dutandukanye (urugero: Remera, Karama, Ngoma, Murambi\u2026)."}
{"id": "3399", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3399", "title": "Intara z\u2019u Rwanda", "text": "Intara z\u2019u Rwanda ni inzego nini z\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019u Rwanda. U Rwanda rufite intara enye n\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali.\nBuri ntara igabanyijemo uturere. Intara enye n\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali bifite uturere 30.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nKera, inzego nini z\u2019ubutegetsi z\u2019u Rwanda zitwaga perefegitura. Muri 2002, perefegitura zahinduriwe izina zitwa intara.\nU Rwanda rwari rufite intara 12. Ku itariki ya 1 Mutarama 2006, izo ntara 12 zasimbuwe n\u2019intara enye n\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali.\nImiterere.\nIntara ntabwo ari urwego rw\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019ibanze. Intara ihuza guverinoma n\u2019uturere. Intara ikurikirana uko uturere dutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda za Leta.\nBuri ntara iyoborwa na guverineri. Guverineri ashyirwaho na Perezida wa Repubulika. Sena yemeza ishyirwaho rye.\nInzego z\u2019ubutegetsi mu Rwanda ni izi:"}
{"id": "3401", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3401", "title": "Akagari", "text": "Akagari (ubwinshi: \"utugari\") ni urwego rw'imitegekere y'u Rwanda ruri munsi y'umurenge. Akagari kagizwe n'imidugudu.\nU Rwanda rufite utugari 2 148. Akagari kayoborwa n'Ubunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa. Gafite kandi Inama Njyanama.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nImiterere.\nImitegekere y'u Rwanda ifite inzego eshanu. Izo nzego ni intara n'Umujyi wa Kigali, uturere, imirenge, utugari n'imidugudu. U Rwanda rufite uturere 30, imirenge 416, utugari 2 148 n'imidugudu 14 837. Iyi miterere ishingiye ku Itegeko Ngenga No 29 ryo mu 2005.\nImikorere.\nItegeko No 87/2013 ryo ku wa 11 Nzeri 2013 rigena imitunganyirize n'imikorere y'inzego z'imitegekere y'Igihugu zegerejwe abaturage. Iri tegeko rigena inshingano z'akagari. Rigena kandi Inama Njyanama y'akagari n'Ubunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa bwako. Ubunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa buyoborwa n'Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa w'akagari.\nInama Njyanama y'akagari.\nAbajyanama b'akagari batorerwa manda y'imyaka itanu. Inama Njyanama y'akagari igizwe na:\nAkagari gatora umujyanama rusange umwe. Uwo mujyanama ahagararira akagari mu Nama Njyanama y'umurenge."}
{"id": "3404", "revid": "16390", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3404", "title": "Nili", "text": "Uruzi rwa Nili mu busanzwe rufatwa nk'uruzi runini ku isi,rubarirwa ku burebure bwa kilometero 6,650 n\u2019ubugari bwa kilometero 8. Muri rusange rufatwa nk\u2019ururerure ku isi, kandi ni rwo ruzi runini mu zitemba zerekeza mu majyaruguru y\u2019Afurika.\nIgihugu cya Misiri tuzi neza ko gitunzwe n'uruzi rwa Nil, uru ruzi rero rukaba rufite isoko iva mu bihugu byinshi aribyo: Etiyopiya, Sudani, Rwanda, Tanzaniya, Yuganda, Uburundi, \nRepubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Eritereya na Kenya. \nNili igizwe imigezi ibiri minini: Nili Yera izwi ku izina rya Bahr Al Jabal muri Sudani, na Nili y\u2019Ubururu yinjiza amenshi mu mazi y\u2019uruzi rwa Nili, ikaba ari na yo ikeshwa ifumbire iboneka mu gishanga Nili inyuramo.\nUruzi rwa Nili y\u2019Umuhondo (\"Yellow Nile\"), ni rwo rwahuzaga Nili nini n\u2019imisozi ya Ouadda\u00ef yo muri Cadi y\u2019uburasirazuba mu myaka ya za 8000 kugera mu 1000 mbere y\u2019ivuka rya Yesu. Igice cyayo gisigaye kizwi ku izina rya Wadi Howar. "}
{"id": "3406", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3406", "title": "Nili Yera", "text": "Nili Yera (izina mu cyarabu: \u0627\u0644\u0646\u064a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0628\u064a\u0636)\nUru ruzi rusohoka mu kiyaga cya Victoria hafi y\u2019umujyi wa Jinja (Uganda), rwitwa \"Nili ya Victoria\" (\"Victoria Nile\"). Rukomeza intera igera kuri kilometero 500 runyuze mu kiyaga cya Kyoga, rukisuka mu kiyaga cya Albert aho rusohoka rwitwa \"Nili ya Albert\" (\"Albert Nile\"). "}
{"id": "3407", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3407", "title": "Nili y\u2019Ubururu", "text": "Nili y\u2019Ubururu (izina mu cyarabu: \u0627\u0644\u0646\u064a\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0632\u0631\u0642)\nUru ruzi rusohoka mu kiyaga cya Tana mu misozi miremire ya Etiopiya, hafi y\u2019umujyi wa Bahir Dar. Rutemba intera ya kilometero 1,400 rwerekeza i Khartoum aho ruhurira na Nili Year bigakora Nili muri rusange. "}
{"id": "3409", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3409", "title": "Intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda", "text": "Intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru ni imwe mu ntara enye z\u2019u Rwanda. Iri mu majyaruguru y\u2019igihugu. Ibiro byayo biri mu Akarere ka Musanze.\nIfite ubuso bwa 3 293,3 km\u00b2 n\u2019abaturage 2 038 511 (2022). Igizwe n\u2019uturere dutanu, kandi ihana imbibi na Ubugande na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nIntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru yashyizweho n\u2019Itegeko Ngenga n\u00b0 29/2005 ryo ku wa 31 Ukuboza 2005. Iryo tegeko ryagabanyije u Rwanda mu ntara enye n\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali.\nMbere y\u2019icyo gihe, u Rwanda rwari rufite intara 12. Kugeza mu 2002, izo ntara zitwaga perefegitura. Intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru yahurije hamwe intara za kera za Ruhengeri na Byumba. Yongeyeho kandi igice cy\u2019intara ya Kigali Ngali.\nItegeko ryashyize icyicaro cy\u2019Intara i Kinihira, mu Akarere ka Rulindo. Ubu ibiro by\u2019Intara biri mu Murenge wa Cyuve, mu Akarere ka Musanze. Guverineri w\u2019Intara ni Maurice Mugabowagahunde, kuva ku wa 10 Kanama 2023.\nImiterere n\u2019imbibi.\nIntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru ihana imbibi n\u2019ibihugu bibiri. Mu majyaruguru ihana imbibi na Ubugande na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mu burasirazuba ihana imbibi n\u2019Intara y'Iburasirazuba. Mu burengerazuba ihana imbibi n\u2019Intara y'Uburengerazuba. Mu majyepfo ihana imbibi n\u2019Intara y'Amajyepfo n\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali. Ikiyaga cya Muhazi kiri ku rubibi rwayo rw\u2019amajyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba.\nKu wa 11 Kamena 2026, u Rwanda rwatangije gahunda yo gusaba ko Intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru yemerwa nka UNESCO Global Geopark. Hamaze kugaragazwa ahantu 16 hafite agaciro mu bumenyi bw\u2019isi. Muri aho hantu harimo Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga, Ubuvumo bwa Musanze, Ikiyaga cya Burera, Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo n\u2019Urugezi. Iyo geopark yaba iya mbere mu Rwanda.\nUturere.\nIntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru igizwe n\u2019uturere 5, imirenge 89, utugari 414 n\u2019imidugudu 2 740.\nUbucucike ni abaturage 622 kuri km\u00b2."}
