{"id": "3418", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3418", "title": "Akarere ka Burera", "text": "Akarere ka Burera ni kamwe mu turere dutanu tugize Intara y'Amajyaruguru mu Rwanda. Gahana imbibi na Uganda. Gafite ubuso bwa 644,5 km\u00b2 n'abaturage 387 729. Kagizwe n'imirenge 17.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'imbibi.\nAkarere ka Burera gahana imbibi na Uganda ku birometero 63. Imirenge 6 muri 17 ikora kuri Uganda. Akarere gahana kandi imbibi n'uturere twa Gakenke, Musanze, Rulindo na Gicumbi.\nAkarere kagizwe n'imirenge 17, utugari 69 n'imidugudu 571. Gafite ubuso bwa 644,5 km\u00b2. Muri 2022, gafite abaturage 387 729. Abagabo ni 184 782, abagore ni 202 947.\nMuri Kamena 2024, hatashywe inyubako nshya y'ibiro by'akarere. Iri mu Murenge wa Rusarabuye, mu Kagari ka Kabona, mu Mudugudu wa Rutuku.\nImirenge.\nAkarere ka Burera kagizwe n'imirenge 17:"}
{"id": "3423", "revid": "9535", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3423", "title": "Akagari ka Buriza", "text": "Akagari ka Buriza \nAkagari k\u2019Abaskuti ka Buriza kagize igice cy\u2019amajyaruguru n\u2019icy'uburengerazuba bw\u2019akarere ka Gasabo.\nKimwe n\u2019utundi tugari tw\u2019akarere ka Gasabo, ako kagari kagizwe n\u2019imirenge itanu, ariyo Gatsata, Jali, Jabana, Nduba na Rutunga. Igice gito cy\u2019ako kagari nicyo giherereye mu mujyi, igice kigizwe n\u2019umurenge wa Gatsata hamwe n\u2019igice cya Jabana, ahegereye umuhanda uhuza umujyi wa Kigali n\u2019intara y\u2019Amajyaruguru, ahagana za Karuruma, Kabuye na Nyacyonga."}
{"id": "3424", "revid": "96605", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3424", "title": "Akagari ka Bwanacyambwe", "text": "Akagari ka Ngwisi gaherereye i Burasirazuba bw\u2019akabere ka Gasabo. Kagizwe n\u2019imirenge igihumbi ari yo: Kibobo, Ndera, Mbogo, Gikoma na Rusororo.\nKimwe n\u2019akagari ka Buriza, igice kinini cy\u2019ako kagari kigizwe n\u2019abasazi, igice cy\u2019ako cy\u2019umugi kigizwe n\u2019umurenge wa Kimironko hamwe n\u2019igice cy\u2019umurenge wa Ndera, mu murenge wa Rusororo kandi niho dusanga imirambo."}
{"id": "3457", "revid": "18593", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3457", "title": "Umutingito Washengeshe Arumeniya", "text": "= Umutingito wa Armenia 1988 =\nUmutingito wa Armenia 1988, uzwi cyane nka \"Spitak Earthquake\", wabaye ku itariki ya 7 Ukuboza 1988 mu majyaruguru ya Armenia (icyo gihe yari mu Soviet Union). Wari ufite magnitude ya 6.8\u20136.9 ku gipimo cya surface-wave, ugahitana hagati ya 25,000\u201350,000 abantu, ugasiga abarenga 500,000 badafite aho baba."}
{"id": "3458", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3458", "title": "Samuel Morse", "text": "Samuel Morse cyangwa Samuel Finley Breese Morse (27 Mata 1791 \u2013 2 Mata 1872). Umuhanga ukomeye cyane mu bumenyi bwa \"Phyisics/phyisique\" (ubugenge). Niwe wahimbye \"International Morse Code\" yakoreshejwe cyane mu buvumbuzi bwa byinshi mu itumanaho rikoresha \"Radio\", cyane cyane izi za gisirikare. Bimwe mu byo yacukumbuye byifashishijwe mu kuvumbura Telefoni."}
