{"id": "3529", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3529", "title": "Noruveje", "text": "Noruveje cyangwa Norvege (izina mu kinyanoruveji bokm\u00e5l: \"Norge\" ; izina mu kinyanoruveji nayinorusiki: \"Noreg\") n\u2019igihugu mu Burayi.umurwa mukuru ni oslo.\nMuri Noruveje, hari imyaka cumi y\u2019indero y\u2019intango umwana wese ategerezwa kwiga; bisigura yuko ababyeyi bategerezwa kurungika abana babo mu mashure bakanakora kuburyo imyimenyerezo bahawe bayikora. Ishure ritoya n\u2019ishure rikuru ritangura vyigwa kuri gusa, kandi ubutegetsi bw\u2019agace ubamwo buriha ibitabo vy\u2019amashure y\u2019abana. \nW\u2019umwana wabo maze bagafata ingingo niba umwana wabo azogira iki Noruveje nk\u2019ururimi rwa mbere canke urwa kabiri. Umunyeshure ashobora guhindura akava mu ki Noruveje nk\u2019ururimi rwa kabiri akaja mu masomo asanzwe akoresha iki Noruveje mu gihe cose azoba yiga."}
{"id": "3531", "revid": "116866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3531", "title": "Ikinyankore", "text": "Ikinyankore ni ururimi rw\u2019abanyankore na rw\u2019Uganda. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 nyn.\nAbanyankore bita ururimi rwabo \"Runyankole\" cyangwa \"Runyankore\".\nMu nyandiko ziza gukurikira hari aho tuza kuvuga ngo ijambo iri n\u2019iri rifitanye isano n\u2019ururimi rw\u2019ikinyankore (abanyankore bita ururimi rwabo urunyankore). Ubundi twagombye kuvuga Runyankore-Rukiga, mu magambo abiri ahujwe n\u2019akarongo gatambitse. Twasanze gukoresha ariya magambo abiri byajijisha kandi icyo tugamije ari ugusobanura ku buryo bwumvikana kuri bose, ntakwibaza ibindi bibazo. Kubafite amatsiko, abakiga bita ururimi rwabo urukiga naho abanyankore bakita ururimi rwabo urunyankore. Izi ndimi zombi rero zirasa cyane, kimwe nk\u2019ikinyarwanda n\u2019ikirundi."}
{"id": "3534", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3534", "title": "Ikirundi", "text": "Ikirundi (cyitwa kandi \"Kirundi\" cyangwa \"Rundi\") ni ururimi rwo mu muryango w'indimi z'Ikibantu, kikaba ururimi rw'igihugu cy'Uburundi. Kivugwa n'abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 12,5, cyane cyane mu Burundi, ariko no mu bice byegeranye na bwo by'u Rwanda, Tanzaniya na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ndetse no muri Ubugande. Ikirundi n'Ikinyarwanda birumvikana hagati yabyo, kandi byombi bigize itsinda rimwe ry'imvugo zegeranye ryitwa Ikinyarwanda-Ikirundi.\nAbakivuga n'aho kivugwa.\nIkirundi ni ururimi kavukire rw'abagera kuri 97 % by'abaturage b'Uburundi (abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 11). Kivugwa kandi n'abantu bagera ku 576 000 mu Rwanda, 512 000 muri Tanzaniya na 246 000 mu Bugande.\nKivugwa n'Abahutu, Abatutsi n'Abatwa, ndetse n'Abahima. Imvugo z'Ikirundi zo hafi y'umupaka wa Tanzaniya zumvikana n'Igiha, ururimi ruvugwa mu burengerazuba bwa Tanzaniya.\nIsano n'Ikinyarwanda.\nIkirundi n'Ikinyarwanda ni imvugo ebyiri z'ururimi rumwe, zifite amagambo menshi ahuye n'imiterere y'ikibonezamvugo isa. Bimwe mu bitandukanya izo ndimi zombi bigaragara mu myandikire no mu magambo amwe n'amwe:\nImiterere y'ururimi.\nAmajwi.\nAbahanga bose bemeranya ko Ikirundi gifite inyajwi eshanu (\"a, e, i, o, u\"); buri nyajwi ishobora kuba ngufi cyangwa ndende, kandi iryo tandukaniro rihindura igisobanuro cy'ijambo. Umubare w'ingombajwi wo uratandukana bitewe n'abanditsi, uri hagati ya 19 na 26.\nIkirundi ni ururimi rufite amajwi y'injyana (\"tons\") abiri: ijwi ryo hejuru n'iryo hasi. Gikunze gukoreshwa nk'urugero rw'itegeko rya Meeussen, risobanura uko amajwi y'injyana ahinduka mu ndimi z'Ikibantu.\nImiterere y'amagambo.\nIbyumvikanyo by'Ikirundi bigizwe ahanini n'ingombajwi ikurikiwe n'inyajwi (CV). Kimwe n'Ikinyarwanda, Ikirundi gikoresha ibyiciro 16 by'amazina (\"classes nominales\") by'indimi z'Ikibantu; byinshi muri byo bigenda ari bibiri bibiri (ubumwe n'ubwinshi), urugero: umurundi / abarundi. Cyandikishwa inyuguti z'Ikilatini.\nAmateka n'ikoreshwa mu butegetsi.\nItegeko Nshinga ry'Ubwami bw'Uburundi ryo mu 1962 ryemeje Ikirundi nk'ururimi rwemewe mu butegetsi. Inyandiko nyinshi za Leta, cyane cyane izasohotse mu kinyamakuru \"Bulletin officiel du Burundi\" hagati ya 1962 na 1963, zandikwaga mu Igifaransa no mu Kirundi. Nyuma y'aho iryo Tegeko Nshinga rihagarikiwe mu 1966, Ikirundi cyakomeje gukoreshwa nk'ururimi rwemewe, nubwo cyagiye gikoreshwa gake mu nyandiko za Leta. Mu 1972, Ikirundi cyagizwe ururimi rwigishwamo mu mashuri abanza y'u Burundi.\nMu 2020, hashyizweho Akademiya y'Ikirundi (\"Acad\u00e9mie rundi\") igamije gutunganya no guteza imbere ururimi."}
{"id": "3535", "revid": "107777", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3535", "title": "Igiswahili", "text": "Igiswahili cyangwa Igiswahiri (na igiswayili cyangwa igiswayiri) ni ururimi rwa Kenya, Tanzaniya, Ubugande, Rwanda, Burundi na Zayire. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 swa.\nUrurimi rw\u2019igiswahiri ni rumwe mu ruzahuza abaturage benshi batuye mu Bihugu 5 bigeze Umuryango w\u2019Ibihugu by\u2019Iburasirazuba EAC aribyo u Burundi n\u2019u Rwanda. Nubwo ibyo Bihugu bifite amateka amwe ariko bikaba bitandukanywa n\u2019uburyo byakoronejwe, ibyo bigatuma bivuga indimi zitandukanye cyane cyane icyongereza kivugwa mu Bihugu bitatu byakoronijwe n\u2019abongereza aribyo Uganda, Kenya na Tanzaniya, naho u Burundi n\u2019u Rwanda byakoronijwe n\u2019u Bubiligi bikavuga Igifaransa, usanga ururimi rw\u2019igiswahili ari rwo abaturage benshi abize n\u2019abatize bahuriraho mu buzima bwa buri munsi akaba ari narwo rurimi ruvugwa cyane mu mibanire y\u2019abatuye EAC cyane cyane urwo rurimi rukaba rukoreshwa mu bucuruzi, mu muziki, mu mikino, mu madini n\u2019ahandi, naho igifaransa n\u2019icyongereza bikavugwa mu buzimam mu buyobozi.\nMu rwego mpuzamahanga, Igiswahili gifata intera kirushaho gukoreshwa dore ko ubu kibarirwa mu ndimi zigenda zirushaho kuvugwa n\u2019abantu benshi cyane cyane mu nganda, ubuhahirane n\u2019ubucuruzi.\nIzo mpamvu zose nizo zatumye ikinyamakuru Izuba Rirashye ryegereye Abanyarwanda batandukanye mu duce twose tw\u2019Igihugu, mu rwego rwo kumenya uko bafata urwo rurimi n\u2019uruhare babona rwagira mu kuzahuza abatuye EAC, dore ko unasanga Abanyarwanda batari bake bavuga Igiswahili.\nImyandikire y\u2019igiswayire.\nIgiswayire kigizwe n'inyuguti 24: a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p r s t u v w y z\ninyajwi 5: a e i o u\ningombajwi 26: b ch d dh f g gh h j k kh l m n ng\u2019 ny p r s sh t th v w y z \nibihekane: mb mv mw nd ng nj nz"}
{"id": "3539", "revid": "9914", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3539", "title": "Ay\u2019urukundo (filimi)", "text": "filimi Ay\u2019urukundo \nNk\u2019uko twabitangarijwe na Willy Ndahiro, filimi amosozi y\u2019urukundo yaje kwitwa Ay\u2019urukundo mu minsi mike irerekanwa ku mugaragaro, uyu Willy akaba ariwe wayikoze afatanyije na Stave Ntasi, ni filimi imara isaha n\u2019igice ikaba ivuga inkuru y\u2019umusore wigaga i mahanga waje gukundwa n\u2019umwali bahuriyeyo, umusore ntiyamukunda kubera ingeso zitari nziza uwo mwali yari afite. amasomo arangiye baratashye, umusore abenguka undi mwali wari umunyuze ariko uwo bavanye i mahanga bimutera ishyali rimukoresha ibyaje gutuma akurikiranwa n\u2019ubuyobozi."}
