{"id": "3547", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3547", "title": "Icyabukaziyani", "text": "Abukaziyani \n, officially the Republic of abukazinia, is a transcontinental country located mainly in Anatolia (Western Asia), with a smaller portion in East Thrace (Southeast Europe). \nKey Facts\n(izina mu abukaziyani: \"\u0430\u04a7\u0441\u0443\u0430 \u0431\u044b\u0437\u0448\u04d9\u0430\" cyangwa \"\u0430\u04a7\u0441\u0448\u04d9\u0430\") ni ururimi rwa Abukaziya na Turukiya. \numugereka \u2013 ubuke.\n-\u049b\u04d9\u0430"}
