{"id": "3549", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3549", "title": "Alexandre Kimenyi", "text": "Kimenyi Alexandre avuka i Rwanda. Ni umwe mu bagize amahirwe yo kwiga amashuri makuru mu gihe cye. Mu mwaka w\u20191971 nibwo yagiye kwiga muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Ntiyabashije kugaruka mu Rwanda, bityo n\u2019abo yahasize ntibongeye guhura nawe ukundi, benshi muri bo bahitanywe na Jenoside. Yaje kubona ubwenegihugu bwa Amerika, akomerezayo imirimo ye nk\u2019umwarimu w\u2019indimi n\u2019Ubuvanganzo.\nMu buzima bwe, yafashe umwanya munini wo gutekereza, kwiga no gukora ubushakashatsi ku mahano n\u2019ubugome ndengakamere ikiremwamuntu kigirira ikindi hirya no hino ku isi. Yatangiye no gutegura inyigisho (\"courses/lectures\") zibyerekeyeho. Yanyuze mu nzira z\u2019inzitane kugira ngo abashe kurangiza amashuri ye nk\u2019uko yabyifuzaga."}
{"id": "3552", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3552", "title": "Ikimokisha", "text": "Ikimokisha (izina mu kimokisha: \"\u043c\u043e\u043a\u0448\u0435\u043d\u044c \u043a\u044f\u043b\u044c\" cyangwa \"mokshanj k\u00e4lj\") ni ururimi rw\u2019abamokisha na rwa Morodoviya. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 mdf.\nAlfabeti y\u2019ikimokisha.\nIkimokisha kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 33: \u0430 \u0431 \u0432 \u0433 \u0434 \u0435 \u0451 \u0436 \u0437 \u0438 \u0439 \u043a \u043b \u043c \u043d \u043e \u043f \u0440 \u0441 \u0442 \u0443 \u0444 \u0445 \u0446 \u0447 \u0448 \u0449 \u044a \u044b \u044c \u044d \u044e \u044f"}
{"id": "3553", "revid": "9535", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3553", "title": "Umuvugizi (ikinyamakuru)", "text": "Umuvugizi: The Voice of Rwanda\nUmuvugizi is a Rwandan satiric news source. It is a Kinyarwanda bi-monthly newspaper and instant publishing website in both Kinyarwanda and English featuring satirical and sensational articles almost exclusively on political issues and events in Rwanda. Umuvugizi started as a highly critical newspaper but became increasingly erratic and satirical against the Rwandan government, its leadership and the president. \nTogether with its sister newspaper, Umuseso, the main focus of their articles was that there was going to be another genocide soon, that Rwanda was undermining the security of its neighbours, that military coups in the country were eminent and so on. It was temporarily suspended in 2010 by the Rwandan Media High Council for \"inciting public disorder\" and defamation in breach of the media law, and its editor was sentenced to 2 and a half years in prison by the Supreme Court on the same charges.\nSince last year (2010) Umuvugizi publishes its satirical articles mostly on its website and its English page started in June 2011. Umuvugizi articles mix both fictional, imagined and real events in and about Rwanda or any world news and information and uses them to justify its claims about leadership failure in the country, conspiracies about leadership corruption, murders and attempted murders by the country's political and military leadership, calls for civil war to change the regime, instilling fear among its readers encouraging Rwandans to flee the country, dissuading Rwandan refugees from returning to their country especially those who live in Europe and the USA etc.\nIt prefaces all its articles as information from \"credible sources\". It has recently started to post fictional audio recordings on its website about assassination attempts by the government against its opponents and claims it sources the audio records and other stories from anonymous Rwandan \"intelligence agents\" and other sources it always does not name \"for security reasons.\"\nUmuvugizi articles capitalise on \"analysis\" - explaining and predicting news and events in Rwanda and never revisits its false claims when the events it tries to link to each other later prove untrue as is always the case. The reach of its current readership is not known, but the news source is ALWAYS critical of the Rwandan government and ALWAYS promotes the views and agenda of foreign and local critics, opposition groups and individuals against Rwanda, and most especially its leadership and politics.\nIt is also not known if its Rwandan and foreign readership are aware of its highly satirical nature that is saturated with overt elements of rogue political mobilisation."}
{"id": "3554", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3554", "title": "Ingagi zo mu birunga", "text": "Ingagi zo mu birunga, zitwa kandi ingagi zo mu misozi miremire (izina ry'ubumenyi: \"Gorilla beringei beringei\"), ni bumwe mu bwoko buto bubiri bw'ingagi zo mu burasirazuba bwa Afurika. Ziboneka gusa ahantu habiri ku isi: mu misozi y'Ibirunga, ahahurira u Rwanda, Uganda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, no mu ishyamba rya Bwindi muri Uganda.\nUmuryango mpuzamahanga wita ku kubungabunga ibidukikije (IUCN) uzishyira mu bwoko buri mu kaga. Mu mwaka wa 2018 habarurwaga ingagi zo mu birunga zigera ku 1 063 ku isi yose. Zamenyekanye cyane kubera ubushakashatsi bwa Dian Fossey, kandi ni imwe mu nkingi z'ubukerarugendo bw'u Rwanda.\nIshyirwa mu byiciro n'ivumburwa.\nIngagi zo mu birunga ni ubwoko buto bw'ingagi zo mu burasirazuba (\"Gorilla beringei\"), hamwe n'ingagi zo mu bibaya byo mu burasirazuba (\"G. b. graueri\"). Abahanga bamwe bakeka ko ingagi zo mu ishyamba rya Bwindi zaba ari ubundi bwoko buto bwihariye.\nMu Kwakira 1902, umusirikare w'Umudage Robert von Beringe yarashe ingagi ebyiri mu rugendo rwo kugena imipaka y'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba y'Abadage. Imwe muri zo yoherejwe mu nzu ndangamurage y'ibinyabuzima i Berlin, aho umuhanga Paul Matschie yayise \"Gorilla beringei\", ayitirira uwayirashe. Mu 1925, Umunyamerika Carl Akeley yemeje umwami Albert I w'Ububiligi gushyiraho Pariki ya Albert (ubu ni Pariki y'igihugu ya Virunga), kugira ngo arinde inyamaswa zo mu Birunga.\nImiterere y'umubiri.\nUbwoya bw'ingagi zo mu birunga ni burebure kandi ni bwinshi kurusha ubw'izindi ngagi, bigatuma zishobora kubaho ahantu hakonje. Buri ngagi igira ishusho y'izuru yihariye, ifasha abashakashatsi kuzitandukanya. Ingabo zikuze zirusha cyane ingore ubunini, kandi zigira ubwoya bw'ibara ry'ifeza ku mugongo, niyo mpamvu zitwa \"silverback\" (\u00abumugongo w'ifeza\u00bb). Iyo zihagaze, ingabo zikuze zigira uburebure bwa metero 1,61 kugeza kuri 1,71, n'ibiro biri hagati ya 120 na 191; ingore zo ni nto, zipima hagati y'ibiro 70 na 98.\nIngagi zigenda ku maguru ane zishingikirije ku mugongo w'intoki, kandi amaboko yazo arusha amaguru uburebure. Zigira amenyo ameze nk'ay'abantu, atuma zishobora guhekenya ibimera byinshi; ingabo zikuze zigira imikaka minini zikoresha iyo zirwana.\nAho ziba.\nIngagi zo mu birunga ziba mu amashyamba y'imisozi miremire ahorana ibicu, igihu n'ubukonje. Mu Birunga, amatsinda menshi aba ku mabanga y'ibirunga bitatu bizimye: Karisimbi, Mikeno na Bisoke. Ibimera biba ari byinshi cyane hasi ku misozi, bikagenda bigabanuka uko uzamuka; ingagi zimara igihe kinini mu mashyamba y'ibiti bya \"Hagenia\" no mu mashyamba y'imigano.\nZirinzwe muri pariki enye:\nMuri izo pariki harimo kandi andi moko y'ibinyabuzima arinzwe n'amasezerano mpuzamahanga ya CITES.\nImibereho.\nIbyo zirya.\nIngagi zo mu birunga zirya ahanini ibimera. Amababi, imishibu, uduti n'imitima yatwo bigize hafi 86 % by'ibyo zirya, biva ku moko y'ibimera agera ku 142. Zirya kandi ibishishwa by'ibiti, imizi, indabo n'imbuto, ndetse rimwe na rimwe udukoko. Kubera ko zikeneye ibiryo byinshi, zimara igice kinini cy'umunsi zirisha, zikaruhuka saa sita; buri mugoroba buri ngagi yiyubakira icyari cy'ibimera iraramo.\nImiryango.\nIngagi zibana mu matsinda ahamye ayoborwa n'ingabo ikuze. Hafi 61 % by'amatsinda agizwe n'ingabo imwe ikuze n'ingore nyinshi, naho 36 % akagira ingabo zikuze zirenze imwe. Itsinda ntirirwanira ubutaka: ingabo iriyobora irinda itsinda ryayo aho kurinda aho riba. Amatsinda ahora yimuka ashaka ibyo kurya.\nItumanaho.\nAbashakashatsi bamaze kumenya amajwi 25 atandukanye ingagi zo mu birunga zikoresha. Menshi muri yo azifasha gushyikirana mu bimera byinshi aho zitabasha kubonana: urugero, iyo zigenda, amajwi magufi asa no kwitotomba agaragaza aho buri ngagi iherereye mu itsinda.\nIyo ingabo ikuze ishaka gutera ubwoba cyangwa kwerekana imbaraga zayo, ikora ibikorwa bikurikirana: irasakuza, igahagarara ku maguru abiri, ikajugunya ibimera, ikikubita mu gituza n'ibiganza, ikiruka iruhande, igashishimura ibimera, hanyuma igakubita hasi ibiganza.\nUbushakashatsi.\nUmunyamerika George Schaller yamaze amezi 20 yiga ingagi zo mu birunga guhera mu 1959, nyuma atangaza ibitabo bibiri bya mbere bisobanura imibereho yazo. Mu 1967, Dian Fossey yatangiye ubushakashatsi bwamaze imyaka 18 mu Birunga by'u Rwanda; igitabo cye \"Gorillas in the Mist\" (1983) cyatumye isi yose imenya izi ngagi. Fossey yiciwe mu Birunga mu Ukuboza 1985, nyuma y'imyaka myinshi arwanya ubuhigi bw'ingagi.\nIbarura n'umubare wazo.\nUmubare w'ingagi zo mu birunga wagiye wiyongera buhoro buhoro kuva mu myaka ya 1980:\nIbarura ryo mu 2010 ryasanze mu Birunga hari ingagi 480 ziri mu miryango 36, hamwe n'ingabo 14 zibana zonyine; bivuze ko umubare wazo wiyongereyeho 26,3 % mu myaka irindwi, ni ukuvuga 3,7 % buri mwaka. Iyo ubishyize hamwe, mu 2018 ingagi zo mu birunga zari zigera ku 1 063 ku isi yose.\nAmatsinda yamenyerejwe kwegerwa n'abantu (ku bw'ubushakashatsi n'ubukerarugendo) yiyongera vuba kurusha andi, kuko arindwa cyane kandi akavurwa n'abaganga b'amatungo iyo yafashwe n'imitego cyangwa n'indwara.\nKubungabunga n'ubukerarugendo.\nMu 1978 ni bwo umushinga \"Mountain Gorilla Project\" (\"Projet Gorille de Montagne\") watangiye, maze ingagi zo mu gice cy'u Rwanda zitangira kumenyerezwa gusurwa n'abakerarugendo. Ubukerarugendo bw'ingagi bwahindutse isoko y'ingenzi y'amafaranga yo kurinda pariki, kandi bukurura ba mukerarugendo benshi mu karere.\nKubera ibikorwa byo kuzibungabunga, umubare wazo wariyongereye ku buryo mu 2018 IUCN yazikuye mu rwego rw'ubwoko \u00abburi mu kaga gakomeye\u00bb (CR), izishyira mu rwego rw'ubwoko \u00abburi mu kaga\u00bb (EN). Imiryango nka Dian Fossey Gorilla Fund International ikomeje ubushakashatsi n'ibikorwa byo kuzirinda.\nUbukerarugendo mu Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda, ingagi zisurwa muri Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga, mu Akarere ka Musanze mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru. Ku wa 6 Gicurasi 2017, Urwego rw\u2019Igihugu rushinzwe Iterambere (RDB) rwazamuye igiciro cy\u2019uruhushya rwo gusura ingagi kiva ku madolari 750 kigera ku 1 500, kandi umugabane w\u2019amafaranga y\u2019ubukerarugendo ugenerwa abaturage baturiye pariki uva kuri 5 % ugera kuri 10 %.\nKwita Izina.\nKuva mu 2005, buri mwaka mu nkengero za Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga, mu Akarere ka Musanze, habera umuhango wa \"Kwita Izina\": abana b\u2019ingagi bavutse muri uwo mwaka bahabwa amazina. Izina ry\u2019uwo muhango rikomoka ku mugenzo nyarwanda wo kwita izina umwana wavutse. Kugeza mu 2025, ingagi nto nibura 438 zari zimaze kwitwa amazina."}
