{"id": "3592", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3592", "title": "Jomo Kenyatta", "text": "Jomo Kenyatta (1894 \u2013 22 Kanama 1978), Perezida wa 1 wa Kenya. Yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa Kenya kuva 1963 kugeza 1964, aba perezida kuva 1964 kugeza 1978.\nAkivuka yiswe Kamau wa Mugai. Jomo Kenyatta Jomo bivuga icumu ribengerana naho Kinyatta bivuga umukandara w\u2019amasaro ya massai. Yitwa kandi Mwalimu mu rurimi rw\u2019igiswayire, umusaza, ise w\u2019igihugu, umwubatsi w\u2019ahera hasenyutse."}
