{"id": "3753", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3753", "title": "Uburusiya", "text": "U Burusiya (izina mu kirusiya: \"\u0420\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0438\u044f\" cyangwa \"\u0420\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0439\u0441\u043a\u0430\u044f \u0424\u0435\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f\") ni igihugu mu Burayi no muri Aziya. Uburusiya butuwe n\u2019abantu barenga 144.463.451 (2017).\nPerezida wacyo ni Vladimir Putin wakomejwe binyuze mu mayeri y\u2019itegeko nshinga."}
