{"id": "3778", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3778", "title": "Igifero", "text": "Igifero (izina mu gifero: \"f\u00f8royskt\") ni ururimi rw\u2019Ibirwa bya Farowe. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 fao.\nAlfabeti y\u2019igifero.\nIgifero kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 29: a \u00e1 b d \u00f0 e f g h i \u00ed j k l m n o \u00f3 p r s t u \u00fa v y \u00fd \u00e6 \u00f8\ninyajwi 13: a \u00e1 e i \u00ed o \u00f3 u \u00fa y \u00fd \u00e6 \u00f8\nindagi 16: b d \u00f0 f g h j k l m n p r s t v "}
