{"id": "3805", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3805", "title": "Isirayeli", "text": "Isirayeli cyangwa Isiraheli, Isiraheri (izina mu giheburayo: \u05d9\u05b4\u05e9\u05b0\u05c2\u05e8\u05b8\u05d0\u05b5\u05dc\u200e\u200e) n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Umurwa mukuru w\u2019Isirayeli witwa Tel Aviv (\"de jure\") na Yerusalemu (\"de facto\"). Igihugu gituwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 8,819,660 (2018), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 20,770\u201322,072."}
