{"id": "3823", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3823", "title": "Kirigizisitani", "text": "Kirigizisitani (izina mu gikirigizi: \"\u041a\u044b\u0440\u0433\u044b\u0437\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 6,019,480 (2016), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 199,951."}
