{"id": "3835", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3835", "title": "Koweti", "text": "Koweti (izina mu cyarabu: \u062f\u0648\u0644\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0648\u064a\u062a) n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 4,052,584 (2016), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 17,818."}
