{"id": "3846", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3846", "title": "Namibiya", "text": "Namibiya (izina mu cyongereza: \"Namibia\") n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika."}
{"id": "3847", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3847", "title": "Madagasikari", "text": "Madagasikari (izina mu kimaragasi: \"Repoblikan'i Madagasikara\" ; izina mu gifaransa: \"R\u00e9publique de Madagascar\") n\u2019igihugu hafi y\u2019inyanja y\u2019Ubuhinde muri Afurika. Umurwa mukuru wa Madagasikari witwa Antananarivo.\nMadagasikari igizwe n\u2019uruhurirane rw\u2019abaturage bakomotse muri Afrika ndetse no mu barabu. Ibyo bituma umuco w\u2019icyo gihugu ugenda ugaragaramo uruvangavange rwakomotse muri ibyo bihugu byose.\nIcyo gihugu gifite amoko agera kuri 18, buri bwoko bukaba bufite umwihariko mu bjyanye n\u2019umuco cyane cyane indirimbo n\u2019imbyino. Muri izo mbyino hakaba harimo salegy, bahoejy, malessa, kilalaka ndetse na vakodrazana."}
{"id": "3848", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3848", "title": "Makawo", "text": "Makawo (izina mu gishinwa: \"\u4e2d\u83ef\u4eba\u6c11\u5171\u548c\u570b\u6fb3\u9580\u7279\u5225\u884c\u653f\u5340\" ; izina mu giporutigali: \"Regi\u00e3o Administrativa Especial de Macau da Rep\u00fablica Popular da China\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya."}
