{"id": "3850", "revid": "122944", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3850", "title": "Malesiya", "text": "Malesiya cyangwa Maleziya (izina mu kimalayi: \"Malaysia\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 31,856,000 (2018), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 330,803."}
{"id": "3853", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3853", "title": "Mali", "text": "Mali (izina mu gifaransa: \"R\u00e9publique du Mali\" ; izina mu kibambara: \"Mali ka Fasojamana\") n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika. Umurwa mukuru wa Mali witwa Bamako."}
{"id": "3854", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3854", "title": "Ikilazi", "text": "Ikilazi (izina mu kilazi: \"lazuri nena\") ni ururimi rwa Turukiya na Geworugiya. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 lzz.\nAlfabeti y\u2019ikilazi.\nIkilazi kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 35: a b c \u00e7 \u00e7\u030c d e f g \u011f h x i j k \u01e9 q l m n o p p\u030c r s \u015f t t\u0306 u v y z \u017e \u0292 \u01ef\ninyajwi 5: a e i o u \nindagi 30: b c \u00e7 \u00e7\u030c d f g \u011f h x j k \u01e9 q l m n p p\u030c r s \u015f t t\u0306 v y z \u017e \u0292 \u01ef"}
{"id": "3856", "revid": "2331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3856", "title": "Igifaransa", "text": "Igifaransa (izina mu gifaransa: \"Fran\u00e7ais\") ni ururimi ruvugwa mu bihugu by\u2019Ubufaransa, Ubusuwisi,Ububirigi,bya Kanada by'umwihariko muri intara ya Qu\u00e9bec. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 fra."}
{"id": "3859", "revid": "15375", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3859", "title": "Umwaka", "text": "Umwaka\nIgice cy'igihe kigizwe n'amezi cumi n'abiri (12) uhereye kuri Mutarama kugeza mu Ukuboza. \nUmwaka ushobora kugira iminsi 365 cyangwa 366 bitewe n'uwo ari wo. \nUwo munsi umwe uranga cyangwa ubura uturuka ku kwezi kwa Gashyantare kugira iminsi makumyabiri n'umunani cyangwa makumyabiri n'icyenda bitewe n'umwaka. \nBuri myaka ine ukwezi kwa kabiri guhindura umubare w'iminsi ikaba 29. Ni ukuvuga ko imyaka itatu ikurikiranye igira ukwezi kwa Gashyantare kw'iminsi 28 maze umwaka ukurikiyeho ugahita uhindura ikaba 29. Imyaka yose igabanyika na kane igira iminsi 366 naho itagabanyika na kane ikagira 365. \nIngero: \nUmwaka mu Rwanda ugabanyijemo ibihe bine by'ingenzi ari byo Urugaryi, Itumba, Icyi, Umuhindo bitandukanywa n'imigwire y'imvura"}
{"id": "3863", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3863", "title": "Malidivezi", "text": "Malidivezi (izina mu kimaldivezi: \u078b\u07a8\u0788\u07ac\u0780\u07a8\u0783\u07a7\u0787\u07b0\u0796\u07ac cyangwa \u078b\u07a8\u0788\u07ac\u0780\u07a8\u0783\u07a7\u0787\u07b0\u0796\u07ad\u078e\u07ac \u0796\u07aa\u0789\u07b0\u0780\u07ab\u0783\u07a8\u0787\u07b0\u0794\u07a7) n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Umurwa mukuru wa Malidivezi witwa Mal\u00e9. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 427,756 (2016), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 298."}
