{"id": "3922", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3922", "title": "Shipure y\u2019Amajyaruguru", "text": "Shipure y\u2019Amajyaruguru cyangwa Shipure Nyaturukiya (izina mu gituruki: \"Kuzey K\u0131br\u0131s\" cyangwa \"Kuzey K\u0131br\u0131s T\u00fcrk Cumhuriyeti\") n\u2019igihugu i Ikirwa cya Shipure muri Aziya. Umurwa mukuru wa Shipure y\u2019Amajyaruguru witwa Nikosiya."}
{"id": "3924", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3924", "title": "Singapore", "text": "Singapore (izina mu cyongereza: \"Singapore\" cyangwa \"Republic of Singapore\" ; izina mu kimalayi: \"Singapura\" cyangwa \"Republik Singapura\" ; izina mu gishinwa: \"\u65b0\u52a0\u5761\" cyangwa \"\u65b0\u52a0\u5761\u5171\u548c\u56fd\" ; izina mu gitamili: \"\u0b9a\u0bbf\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc2\u0bb0\u0bcd\" cyangwa \"\u0b9a\u0bbf\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc2\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bc1\u0b9f\u0bbf\u0baf\u0bb0\u0b9a\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 5,607,300 (2016), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 720."}
{"id": "3925", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3925", "title": "Siri Lanka", "text": "Siri Lanka (izina mu kinyasinali: \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf cyangwa \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dba ; izina mu gitamili: \u0b87\u0bb2\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc8 cyangwa \u0b87\u0bb2\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc8 \u0b9c\u0ba9\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95 \u0b9a\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bc1\u0bb5 \u0b95\u0bc1\u0b9f\u0bbf\u0baf\u0bb0\u0b9a\u0bc1) n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 21,444,000 (2017), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 65,610."}
{"id": "3926", "revid": "14885", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3926", "title": "Siriya", "text": "Siriya (izina mu cyarabu: \u0633\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0629\u200e cyangwa \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0645\u0647\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0629) n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 17,064,854 (2014), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 185,180. Umurwa mukuru w\u2019u Siriya witwa Damasiko."}
{"id": "3927", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3927", "title": "Sivalibadi na Jani Mayeni", "text": "Sivalibadi na Jani Mayeni (izina mu kinyanoruveji: \"Svalbard og Jan Mayen\") n\u2019igihugu mu Burayi."}
{"id": "3928", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3928", "title": "Siyera Lewone", "text": "Siyera Lewone (izina mu cyongereza: \"Sierra Leone\" cyangwa \"Republic of Sierra Leone\") n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika."}
{"id": "3929", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3929", "title": "Somaliya", "text": "Somaliya (izina mu gisomali: \"Soomaaliya\" cyangwa \"Jamhuuriyadda Soomaaliya\" ; izina mu cyarabu: \u0627\u0644\u0635\u0648\u0645\u0627\u0644 cyangwa \u062c\u0645\u0647\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u0648\u0645\u0627\u0644\u200e) ni igihugu muri Afurika. Umurwa mukuru wa Somaliya witwa Mogadishu."}
{"id": "3930", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3930", "title": "Sudani", "text": "Sudani (izina mu cyarabu: \u062c\u0645\u0647\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0648\u062f\u0627\u0646 ; izina mu cyongereza: \"Republic of Sudan\") n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika."}
{"id": "3931", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3931", "title": "Surinamu", "text": "Surinamu (izina mu kinyaholande: \"Suriname\" cyangwa \"Republiek Suriname\" ; izina mu kinyasurinamu: \"Sranangron\" cyangwa \"Sranankondre\") n\u2019igihugu muri Amerika."}
{"id": "3932", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3932", "title": "Suwede", "text": "Suwede (izina mu kinyasuwede: \"Sverige\" cyangwa \"Konungariket Sverige\") n\u2019igihugu mu Burayi."}
{"id": "3933", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3933", "title": "Ubusuwisi", "text": "Ubusuwisi (izina mu kidage: \"die Schweiz\" cyangwa \"Schweizerische Eidgenossenschaft\" ; izina mu gifaransa: \"Suisse\" cyangwa \"Conf\u00e9d\u00e9ration suisse \" ; izina mu gitaliyani: \"Svizzera\" cyangwa \"Confederazione Svizzera\" ; izina mu kiromanshi: \"Svizra\" cyangwa \"Confederaziun svizra \" ; izina mu kilatini: \"Confoederatio Helvetica\") n\u2019igihugu mu Burayi.\nUmurwa mukuru w\u2019Ubusuwisi ni Bern."}
{"id": "3934", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3934", "title": "Eswatini", "text": "Eswatini (izina mu giswati: \"kaNgwane, Swatini\" cyangwa \"Umbuso weSwatini\"; izina mu cyongereza: \"Swaziland\" cyangwa \"Kingdom of Swaziland\") n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika y\u2019Iburengerazuba.\nEswatini igizwe n\u2019aba Nguni bahujwe n\u2019ururimi ndetse n\u2019umuco. Bakomoka muri burasirazuba bwo hagati ya Afurika. Mu gushaka kwaguka kwa Nguni, mu binyejana 15 bishize, aba Swazi bambutse uruzi rwa Limpopo batura mu majyepfo ya Tsongaland.\nMu birori bitandukanye, imbyino zihabwa agaciro cyane. Imbyino ya Umhlanga, ni imbyino ibyinwa mu mpera z\u2019ukwezi kwa 8, ubwo abana b\u2019abakobwa baba baramya umwamikazi. Sibhanca nayo ni imbyino y\u2019abagabo babyina hirya no hino mu gihugu."}
{"id": "3936", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3936", "title": "Tajikisitani", "text": "Tajikisitani (izina mu gitajiki Kinyaperisi: \"\u0422\u043e\u04b7\u0438\u043a\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043d\" cyangwa \"\u04b6\u0443\u043c\u04b3\u0443\u0440\u0438\u0438 \u0422\u043e\u04b7\u0438\u043a\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043d\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 8,734,951 (2016), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 143.100. Umujyi mukuru ya Tadjikistani ni Duchanbe."}
{"id": "3937", "revid": "14965", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3937", "title": "Tayilande", "text": "Tayilande (izina mu gitayi: \u0e23\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e13\u0e32\u0e08\u0e31\u0e01\u0e23\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22) n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Cyahoze cyitwa Siyam. Igihugu gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 68,863,514 (2016), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 513,120. Umwami w'abami n'umugabekazi wa Tayilande ni Tristan Poupart na L\u00e9ane Blanche."}
{"id": "3938", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3938", "title": "Tayiwani", "text": "Tayiwani (igishinwa: \u53f0\u7063), cyangwa Repubulika y\u2019u Bushinwa (igishinwa: \u4e2d\u83ef\u6c11\u570b) ni igihugu muri Aziya. Umurwa mukuru wa Tayiwani witwa Tayipeyi."}
{"id": "3939", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3939", "title": "Teritwari y\u2019Inyanja y\u2019Abahinde Nyongereza", "text": "Teritwari y\u2019Inyanja y\u2019Abahinde Nyongereza (izina mu cyongereza: \"British Indian Ocean Territory\" cyangwa \"Chagos Islands \") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya."}
{"id": "3940", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3940", "title": "Timoro-Lesite", "text": "Timoro-Lesite (izina mu gitetumu: \"Timor-Leste\" cyangwa \"Rep\u00fablika Demokr\u00e1tika Tim\u00f3r-Leste\" ; izina mu giporutigali: \"Rep\u00fablica Democr\u00e1tica de Timor-Leste\" ; izina mu kinyendonisiya: \"Republik Demokratik Timor Leste\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya."}
{"id": "3941", "revid": "15443", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3941", "title": "Tirinida na Tobago", "text": "Tirinida na Tobago (izina mu cyongereza: \"Trinidad and Tobago\" cyangwa \"Republic of Trinidad and Tobago\") n\u2019igihugu muri Amerika."}
{"id": "3942", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3942", "title": "Togo", "text": "Togo (izina mu gifaransa: \"R\u00e9publique Togolaise\") n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika.\nUmutekano.\nKuva ku wa 11 Nzeri 2018, Togo ifite igikorwa cya gisirikare cyitwa Op\u00e9ration Koundjoar\u00e9 mu Ntara ya Savanes, mu majyaruguru y'igihugu, kigamije kurwanya imitwe y'iterabwoba ituruka muri Sahel."}
{"id": "3943", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3943", "title": "Tokelawu", "text": "Tokelawu (izina mu gitokelawu na cyongereza: \"Tokelau\") n\u2019igihugu muri Oseyaniya."}
{"id": "3944", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3944", "title": "Tonga", "text": "Tonga cyangwa Ibirwa bya Tonga (izina mu gitonga: \"Pule\u02bbanga Fakatu\u02bbi \u02bbo Tonga\" ; izina mu cyongereza: \"Kingdom of Tonga\") n\u2019igihugu muri Oseyaniya."}
{"id": "3946", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3946", "title": "Tunisiya", "text": "Tunisiya cyangwa Tuniziya (izina mu cyongereza: \u062a\u0648\u0646\u0633 cyangwa \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0645\u0647\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u064a\u0629\u200e) n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika."}
{"id": "3947", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3947", "title": "Tuvalu", "text": "Tuvalu (izina mu gituvalu na cyongereza: \"Tuvalu\") n\u2019igihugu muri Oseyaniya. Umurwa mukuru wa Tuvalu witwa Funafuti."}
{"id": "3948", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3948", "title": "Ubugande", "text": "Ubugande cyangwa Yuganda, Repubulika y\u2019Ubugande (izina mu cyongereza: \"Republic of Uganda\" ; izina mu giswayili: \"Jamhuri ya Uganda\" ; izina mu kiganda: \"Yuganda\") n\u2019igihugu muri Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba.\nUganda ni igihugu gifite amoko atandukanye afite indimi zigera kuri 40 zitandukanye. Buri bwoko bugira imbyino n\u2019indirimbo byihariye kuri buri birori. Abanyoro bagira imbyino yitwa Runyege, Acholi bagira imbyino za Bwila na Otole. Abaturage ba Alur bagira imbyino yitwa Agwal. Agisu, muco wabo wo gukebwa babyina imbyino za duim, na imbalu. Muri rusange Ibicurangisho bakoresha ni ennaga, amadinda, ndigindi, entongoli na likeme. "}
{"id": "3951", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3951", "title": "Ubuyapani", "text": "Ubuyapani (izina mu kiyapani: \u65e5\u672c\u56fd cyangwa \u65e5\u672c\u570b) n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya. Umurwa mukuru w\u2019Ubuyapani witwa Tokyo."}
{"id": "3952", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3952", "title": "Uzubekisitani", "text": "Uzubekisitani (izina mu cyuzubeka: \"O\u2018zbekiston Respublikasi\" cyangwa \"\u040e\u0437\u0431\u0435\u043a\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043d \u0420\u0435\u0441\u043f\u0443\u0431\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0441\u0438\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya."}
{"id": "3954", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3954", "title": "Vanuwatu", "text": "Vanuwatu (izina mu kibisilamu: \"Ripablik blong Vanuatu\" ;izina mu cyongereza: \"Republic of Vanuatu\" ; izina mu gifaransa: \"R\u00e9publique de Vanuatu\") n\u2019igihugu muri Oseyaniya."}
{"id": "3955", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3955", "title": "Vatikani", "text": "Vatikani cyangwa Umujyi wa Vatikani (izina mu gitaliyani: \"Stato della Citt\u00e0 del Vaticano\") ni igihugu kiri mu majyepfo y'u Burayi. Giherereye rwagati mu Butaliyani."}
{"id": "3956", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3956", "title": "Venezuwela", "text": "Venezuwela (izina mu cyesipanyole: \"Venezuela\" cyangwa \"Rep\u00fablica Bolivariana de Venezuela\") n\u2019igihugu muri Amerika."}
{"id": "3957", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3957", "title": "Walisi na Fatuna", "text": "Walisi na Fatuna (izina mu gifaransa: \"Wallis et Futuna\" cyangwa \"Territoire des \u00eeles Wallis et Futuna\") n\u2019igihugu muri Oseyaniya. Umurwa mukuru wa Walisi na Fatuna witwa Mata-Utu."}
{"id": "3958", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3958", "title": "Yorudani", "text": "Yorudani cyangwa Yorodani (izina mu cyarabu: \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0645\u0644\u0643\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0631\u062f\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0647\u0627\u0634\u0645\u064a\u0629 ; izina mu cyongereza: \"Jordan\" cyangwa \"Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan\") n\u2019igihugu muri Aziya."}
{"id": "3960", "revid": "14547", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3960", "title": "Icyesipanyole", "text": "Icyesipanyole cyangwa Igisipanyoli (izina mu cyesipanyole: \"espa\u00f1ol\" cyangwa \"castellano\") ni ururimi rwa Esipanye, Arijantine, Boliviya, Ekwadoro, Gwatemala, Hondurasi, Irigwe, Kiba, Kolombiya, Kosita Rika, Megizike..."}
{"id": "3965", "revid": "2331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3965", "title": "Igiporutigali", "text": "Igiporutigali cyangwa Inyeporutigali (izina mu giporutigali: \"Portugu\u00eas\" cyangwa \"l\u00edngua portuguesa\") ni ururimi rwa Mozambike, Burezile, Angola, Gineya-Biso, Gineya Ekwatoriyale, Kapu Veri, Mozambike, Sawo Tome na Purensipe, Timoro-Lesite na Makawo."}
{"id": "3970", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3970", "title": "Ikinyafurikansi", "text": "Ikinyafurikansi cyangwa Icyafurikanzi, Ikinyafurikaneri (izina mu kinyafurikansi: \"Afrikaans\") ni ururimi rwa Afurika y\u2019Epfo, Namibiya, Zambiya na Zimbabwe. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 afr."}
{"id": "3971", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3971", "title": "Amazina y\u2019ururimi mu kinyarwanda", "text": "Amazina y\u2019ururimi mu kinyarwanda "}
{"id": "3972", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3972", "title": "Muharramu", "text": "Muharramu (izina mu cyarabu: \u0645\u062d\u0631\u0645) ni ukwezi kwa mbere kuri karendari y\u2019Ubuyisilamu. Abayisilamu b\u2019isi yose bakirana uku kwezi ishavu ryinshi, bibuka Imamu Husseni umwuzukuru w\u2019Intumwa Muhammadi. Imamu Husseni intwari yatabarukiye itabaro ryo kurengera Ubuyisilamu no gutokombeza abasirikare ba Shitani.\nYaguye mu rugamba i Karbala yishwe n\u2019ingabo za Yaziidi mwene Mu\u2019awiya mwene Abu-Sufiyani nyuma yo kwanga kuyoboka ubutegetsi ruvumwa bw\u2019ikirobezo Yaziidi"}
{"id": "3979", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3979", "title": "Umusozi wa Huye", "text": "Umusozi wa Huye\nMu karere ka Huye hari Umusozi wa Huye uzwi cyane, ugaragara aho uhagaze hose mu karere, Muri uwo musozi tuhasanga n\u2019isoko y\u2019amazi afutse azwi mu Rwanda hose. Ayo mazi hari uruganda rwiyemeje kuyashyira mu macupa hanyuma rukayageza ku ba nyarwanda hirya no hino mu gihugu."}
