{"id": "3994", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3994", "title": "Sarudi", "text": "Sarudi (izina mu kilidiya: \"Sfard\" ; izina mu kigereki: \"\u03a3\u03ac\u03c1\u03b4\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2\" ; izina mu kinyaperisi: \u0633\u0627\u0631\u062f ; izina mu gituruki: \"Sardes\") umujyi w'amateka na wari umurwa mukuru w'ubwami bw'i Lidiya i Manisa muri Turukiya."}
{"id": "3995", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3995", "title": "Umurwa", "text": "Umurwa\nIbihugu byateye imbere byanabonye ko ari byiza kugira imirwa ibiri cyangwa se imijyi ibiri: Imurwa w\u2019ubutegetsi (\"political capital\") n\u2019umurwa w\u2019ubucuruzi (\"commercial capital\"). \nIbi nabyo u Rwanda rwari rukwiye kubikora. Kurubu u Rwanda rukaba \nrufite gahunda yo kuba bakongera cyangwa se bakagura umurwa ari nako\nbakora imijyi igiye inyuranye muri buri ntara izajya iyunganira Kigali mu rwego\nrwo kugabanya abimukira bava mucyaro bakimukira muri kigali. No mu rwego rwo kongera imirimo.Iyo mijyi irimo ; Muhanga,Musanze, Nyagatare,Huye,Rusizi na Rubavu "}
{"id": "3996", "revid": "13838", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3996", "title": "Umujyi wa Rubavu", "text": "Umujyi wa rubavu\nUmujyi wa Rubavu uherereye mu Ntara y\u2019uburengerazuba ugahana imbibi n\u2019umujyi wa Goma muri leta ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUyu mujyi urangwa n'imisozi myiza ibikorwaremezo nka:banki,inyubako nziza n'ibindo"}
{"id": "4000", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4000", "title": "Sukumi", "text": "Sukumi (izina mu cyabukaziyani: \"\u0410\u049f\u04d9\u0430\" ; izina mu kinyageworugiya: \"\u10e1\u10dd\u10ee\u10e3\u10db\u10d8\") n\u2019umurwa mukuru w\u2019Abukaziya."}
{"id": "4001", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4001", "title": "Ankara", "text": "Umujyi w\u2019Ankara (izina mu giturukiya: \"Ankara\") n\u2019umurwa mukuru wa Turukiya na n\u2019umurwa mukuru w\u2019Intara y\u2019Ankara. Abaturage 5,001,972.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019intara: Alaaddin Y\u00fcksel\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Melih G\u00f6k\u00e7ek"}
