{"id": "4139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4139", "title": "Intara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru", "text": "Intara ya Kivu y\u2019Amajyaruguru (izina mu gifaransa: \"Province du Nord-Kivu\") ni intara yo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cy'ubukoloni, Ababiligi bimuriye Abanyarwanda benshi muri iyo ntara, cyane cyane i Masisi, binyuze muri gahunda yiswe Inshingano y'abinjira n'abasohoka muri Banyarwanda.\nUburezi.\nMu mujyi wa Beni hari Kaminuza ya Leta ya Semuliki (UOS), kaminuza ya Leta yashinzwe mu 2004."}
{"id": "4140", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4140", "title": "Th\u00e9oneste Bagosora", "text": "Th\u00e9oneste Bagosora (16 Kanama 1941 \u2013 25 Nzeri 2021) yari umusirikare mukuru w'u Rwanda. Yari afite ipeti rya koloneli. Yabaye umuyobozi w'ibiro bya Minisitiri w'Ingabo.\nBagosora yagize uruhare runini muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Mu 2008, Urukiko Mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR) rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Mu 2011, igihano cye cyagabanyijwe kigera ku myaka 35. Yapfiriye muri Mali mu 2021.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nBagosora yavukiye i Giciye, muri perefegitura ya Gisenyi. Ubu ni mu Akarere ka Nyabihu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba. Se yari umwarimu. Mu 1956, Bagosora yinjiye mu iseminari nto ya Nyundo. Yayivuyemo nyuma y'imyaka itandatu. Nyuma yaho, yinjiye mu Ishuri rya Ofisiye (\"\u00c9cole des officiers\") i Kigali. Mu 1964, yabaye su-liyetona.\nUmwuga.\nAhagana mu 1980, Bagosora yayoboye Polisi ya Gisirikare. Mu 1981, yize mu ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare (\"\u00c9cole sup\u00e9rieure de guerre interarm\u00e9es\") i Paris, mu Bufaransa. Ku ya 1 Ukwakira 1990, intambara itangiye, Bagosora yayoboraga ikigo cya gisirikare cya Kanombe. Icyo kigo cyari kinini kurusha ibindi mu gihugu.\nNyuma yaho, Bagosora yabaye umuyobozi w'ibiro (\"directeur de cabinet\") bya Minisitiri w'Ingabo. Yayoboye uruhande rwa leta mu mishyikirano yari ihuje leta na FPR. Muri minisiteri y'ingabo, yari umwe mu bayobozi b'abahezanguni.\nJenoside n'urubanza.\nKu ya 6 Mata 1994, indege ya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana yarahanuwe. Nyuma y'icyo gitero, Bagosora yagize uruhare rukomeye mu guhuza ibikorwa. Yagerageje gufata ubutegetsi akoresheje komite y'abasirikare. Ntibyamuhiriye. Ku ya 21 Gicurasi 1994, yasubijwe mu ngabo.\nMu 1996, Bagosora yafatiwe muri Kameruni. Muri Mutarama 1997, yajyanywe i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya. Yaburanishijwe hamwe n'abandi basirikare batatu. Abo ni Gratien Kabiligi, Aloys Ntabakuze na Anatole Nsengiyumva.\nKu ya 18 Ukuboza 2008, urukiko rwamuhamije icyaha cya jenoside. Rwamuhamije kandi ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu n'ibyaha by'intambara. Rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Urukiko rwamubaze iyicwa rya Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana. Rwamubaze kandi iyicwa ry'abasirikare 10 b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR. Ntabwo rwamuhamije icyaha cyo gucura umugambi wa jenoside. Gratien Kabiligi yagizwe umwere.\nKu ya 14 Ukuboza 2011, urugereko rw'ubujurire rwagabanyije igihano cye. Igihano cyabaye igifungo cy'imyaka 35. Bagosora yarangirizaga igihano cye muri gereza yo muri Mali. Yapfuye ku ya 25 Nzeri 2021, i Bamako. Yari afite imyaka 80."}
{"id": "4147", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4147", "title": "Bernard Makuza", "text": "Makuza Bernard (yavutse 30 Nzeri 1962) ni umunyapolitiki wo \nmu Rwanda wabaye Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019u Rwanda kuva ku ya 8 Werurwe 2000 kugeza ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2011. Yabaye kandi Perezida wa Sena y'u Rwanda kuva ku ya 14 Ukwakira 2014 kugeza ku ya 17 Ukwakira 2019. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nSe wa Makuza yari Anastase Makuza, wabaye minisitiri mu gihe cya Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda. Kimwe na se, Bernard Makuza yitabiriye Seminari Nto ya Saint L\u00e9on ya Kabgayi.\nUmwuga.\nMakuza yari umwe mu bari bagize ishyaka riharanira demokarasi (MDR) mbere yuko ishyaka risenywa ku ya 14 Mata 2003 kubera amateka yaryo yo guteza imbere ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside. Makuza yeguye ku kuba umunyamuryango wa MDR mbere yo kugirwa Minisitiri w\u2019intebe. Mu 2006, muri manda ye ya Minisitiri w\u2019intebe, Makuza yerekanye ko nta shyaka abarizwamo. \nMakuza yari Ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda mu Burundi hanyuma aba Ambasaderi mu Budage mbere yo kugirwa Minisitiri w\u2019intebe muri Werurwe 2000. Ishyirwaho rye kuri uyu mwanya wa nyuma na Perezida Pasteur Bizimungu ryakurikiye ukwegura kwa Minisitiri w\u2019intebe Pierre-C\u00e9lestin Rwigema, wari wanenzwe cyane mu binyamakuru byo mu Rwanda ndetse na bamwe mu badepite. \nMakuza yagumye ku buyobozi bwa guverinoma nshya yitiriwe ku ya 8 Werurwe 2008, yari igizwe n'abaminisitiri 21 n'abanyamabanga batandatu ba Leta. \nSena.\nKu ya 6 Ukwakira 2011, Perezida Kagame yashyizeho Pierre Habumuremyi asimbuye Makuza kuba Minisitiri w\u2019intebe. Makuza ahubwo yagizwe Sena. Muri Sena, Makuza yabaye Visi-Perezida ushinzwe amategeko no kugenzura guverinoma. Nyuma yaje gutorerwa kuba Perezida wa Sena, amajwi 25 kuri 26 ashyigikiwe kandi nta mukandida utavuga rumwe n\u2019ubutegetsi, arahira ku ya 14 Ukwakira 2014. "}
{"id": "4148", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4148", "title": "Frank Habineza", "text": "AMATEKA YA FRANK HABINEZA\nFrank Habineza yavukiye I Mityana muri Uganda mu 1977, ni umunyapolitiki w\u2019umunyarwanda. Ni umwe mu bashinze ishyaka Parti Vert D\u00e9mocratique, aribera perezida wa mbere, kugeza n\u2019ubu ni we ukiriyobora.\nAmashuri ye yayize muri Kaminuza Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda I Butare.\nYashinze ishyaka Parti Vert D\u00e9mocratique muri Kanama 2009, iri rikaba ritavuga rumwe na Leta iyobowe na FPR. Benshi mu bashinze Parti Vert D\u00e9mocratique ni abahoze ari abanyamuryango ba FPR bakaza kuyivamo.\nMuri Werurwe 2010, Habineza yabaye \u201cumutumirwa w\u2019icubahiro muri Kaminuza ny\u2019Afurika yita ku bidukikije y\u2019I Rabat muri Maroke. Iyi nama yari mu rwego rwo kugirango amashyaka aharanira kubungabunga ibidukikije yo muri Afurika ahurize hamwe imbaraga. Ukwezi kwakurikiyeho yahise atorerwa kuba perezida wa komite nshingabikorwa mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amashyaka aharanira ibidukikije muri Afurika. \nIshyaka Parti Vert D\u00e9mocratique Leta y\u2019u Rwanda ntiraryemerera gukora byemewe n\u2019amategeko, ibi bikaba byaratumye rititabira amatora y\u2019umukuru w\u2019igihugu yabaye muri Kanama 2010. Ibi kandi byatumye iri shyaka ritabasha kujya ribona uburenganzira bwo gukora amanama. Mu Kwakira 2009 imwe mu manama y\u2019iri shyaka yahagaritswe na Polisi y\u2019Igihugu.uyu munyepolotiki amaze igihe kinini anyotewe no kuyobora goverinoma y'URWANDA."}
{"id": "4153", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4153", "title": "James Kabarebe", "text": "Gen (Rtd) James Kabarabe yavutse 1959. akurira i Ibanda-Kazo mu majyaruguru ya Uganda, Yize amashuri abanza mu ishuri ribanza Kyamate ryo mu majyaruguru ya Uganda naho icyiciro cyambere cy' amashuri yisumbuye yayize mukigo Kabalega Secondary School muri Masindi, Bunyoro mumumajyaruguru ya Uganda, naho icyiciro cya kabiri cya amashuri yisumbuye yayayize mu kigo kitwa St. Henry's College Kitovu muri 1979. Kaminuza yayize muri Makerere University, aho yahakuye impamyabumenye y'ikiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mubijyanye n'ubukungu na politiki. \nJames kabarebe yafatiwe ibihano n'Amerika.\nAmerika irashinja gen(Rtd)James Kabarebe ariwe wahoze ari minisitiri w'ingabo mu Rwanda ko ari we uri hagati y'ubufasha u Rwanda ruha M23 biryo rero Amerika ikaba yamufatiye ibihano ni mugihe u Rwanda rubihakana kuko rusobanura neza ko rudafasha M23"}
{"id": "4156", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4156", "title": "Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere", "text": "Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere (BAD, \"Banque Africaine De D\u00e9veloppement\") ni ikigo mpuzabihugu nyafurika gitsura amajyembere, gifite icyicaro gikuru mu mujyi wa Abidjan, mu gihugu cya Cote d'Ivoire, guhera muri Nzeri 2014. Banki y'iterambere ry'Afurika ni ikigega gitanga inguzanyo kuri leta z'Afurika n'ibigo byigenga bishora imari mu bihugu bigize akarere. \nBanki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 1964 n'umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika, ari na wo wabimburiye ubumwe bw'Afurika.\nBanki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere igizwe n'ibigo bitatu aribyo Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere, Ikigega Nyafurika Gishinzwe Iterambere na Nigeria Trust Fund.\nIntego.\nInshingano ya AfDB ni ukurwanya ubukene no kunoza imibereho ku mugabane, binyuze mu guteza imbere ishoramari ry'imari ya leta n'ibigo byigenga binyuze mu mishinga na gahunda zishobora kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry'ubukungu n'imibereho myiza y'akarere.\nAfDB kandi ishyigikira gahunda zo guhangana n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere muri Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara. "}
{"id": "4165", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4165", "title": "Landoald Ndasingwa", "text": "Ndasingwa Landoald uzwi ku izina rya Lando yari umunyapolitiki w\u2019umunyarwanda, akaba yari umuyobozi w\u2019 ishyaka riharanira ukwishyira n\u2019 ukwizana (PL). Yishwe mw\u2019 ikubitiro rya jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi ku itariki 7 Mata 1994. "}
{"id": "4171", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4171", "title": "Ubuvanganzo", "text": "Ubuvanganzo ni ijambo ry'ikinyarwanda risobanura \"literature\" mu cyongereza. Ni urwego rw'ubuhanzi rufite intego yo kugaragaza ibitekerezo, amarangamutima, n'ubuzima bw'abantu mu buryo bw'inyandiko. Ubuvanganzo bushobora kubamo ibice bitandukanye, birimo:\nUbuvanganzo bufite uruhare runini mu gusigasira umuco, kugaragaza ibitekerezo by'abantu, no guteza imbere ururimi. Ni uburyo bw'ubuhanzi bufasha abantu kumvaUbuvanganzo \nUbuvanganzo nyarwanda harimo ibisigo, amazina y'inka, ibyivugo, ibisingizo, ibihozo, imigani miremire, ibitekerezo, imigani migufi (imigenurano), inshoberamahanga, insigamigani, \nibisakuzo, amavumvu, amasare, amahigi, amagorane, ibitongero (mu kuragura, guterekera, gutukura umwana, kwambika imana zeze,\nguhura, kugangahura, guhanura, kugombora, kuroga n\u2019ibindi)\nReka tuvuge k'ubuvanganzo Nyarwanda.Ubuvanganzo Nyarwanda bugabanyijemo ibice bibiri aribyo: Ubuvanganzo nyemvugo bwo muri rubanda n'ubuvanganzo nyabami== =="}
