{"id": "4195", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4195", "title": "Michael Jackson", "text": "Michael Jackson (29 Kanama 1958 \u2013 25 Kamena 2009) yari umuririmbyi w'Umunyamerika. Yari n'umuhimbyi w'indirimbo n'umubyinnyi. Azwi cyane ku izina rya \u00ab\u00a0Umwami wa Pop\u00a0\u00bb (\"King of Pop\").\nAlubumu ye \"Thriller\" (1982) ni yo alubumu yagurishijwe cyane kurusha izindi mu mateka. Afatwa nk'umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye mu mateka y'umuziki.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nMichael Jackson yavukiye i Gary, muri Leta ya Indiana, ku wa 29 Kanama 1958. Yari umwana wa munani mu bana icumi ba Joseph na Katherine Jackson. Afite imyaka icyenda, yabaye umuririmbyi mukuru w'itsinda The Jackson 5. Iryo tsinda ryari rigizwe n'abavandimwe be. Ryashinzwe na se. Mu 1969, itsinda ryasinye amasezerano na Motown. Indirimbo zaryo zizwi ni \"I Want You Back\" na \"ABC\".\nUmwuga.\nMu 1971, Michael Jackson yatangiye kuririmba ku giti cye. Mu 1979, yasohoye alubumu \"Off the Wall\". Iyo alubumu yakozwe na Quincy Jones.\nMu 1982, yasohoye alubumu \"Thriller\". Yagurishijwe kopi zigera kuri miliyoni 67 ku isi. Ni yo alubumu yagurishijwe cyane kurusha izindi mu mateka. Yamuhesheje ibihembo umunani bya Grammy. Mu 1983, indirimbo \"Billie Jean\" na \"Beat It\" zagaragaje uburyo bwe bwo kubyina. Muri ubwo buryo harimo intambwe yitwa \"moonwalk\".\nNyuma yaho, yasohoye alubumu \"Bad\" (1987), \"Dangerous\" (1991) na \"HIStory\" (1995). Mu 2001, yinjijwe muri Rock and Roll Hall of Fame.\nMichael Jackson yapfuye ku wa 25 Kamena 2009, i Los Angeles. Yari afite imyaka 50. Yapfuye azize imiti yahawe na muganga we."}
