{"id": "4620", "revid": "2331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4620", "title": "Igihawusa", "text": "Igihawusa (izina mu gihawusa: \"Hausa\" cyangwa \u0647\u064e\u0648\u064f\u0633\u064e) ni ururimi rw\u2019abahawusa na rwa Nijeriya, Nigeri, Bene, Burukina Faso, Gana, Togo na Sudani. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 hau.\nAlfabeti y\u2019igihawusa.\nIgihawusa kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 29: a b \u0253 c d \u0257 e f g h i j k \u0199 l m n o r s sh t ts u w y (\u01b4) z \u02bc\ninyajwi 5: a e i o u \nindagi 24: b \u0253 c d \u0257 f g h j k \u0199 l m n r s sh t ts w y (\u01b4) z \u02bc \nBoko.\nBoko cyangwa Alfabeti ya Kilatini\nAjami.\nAjami cyangwa Alfabeti y\u2019icyarabu "}
{"id": "4624", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4624", "title": "Ilingala", "text": "Ilingala (izina mu lingala: \"Ling\u00e1la\") ni ururimi rwa Repubulika ya Kongo (Kongo Brazzaville) na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (Kongo Kinshasa). Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 lin. Ururimi rwa Lingala rufite aho ruhuriye n'Igiswahili, Ikibemba n'Ikibumundu.\nAlfabeti y\u2019ilingala.\nIlingala kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 35: a b c d e \u025b f g gb h i k l m mb mp n nd ng nk ns nt ny nz o \u0254 p r s t u v w y z\ninyajwi 7: a e \u025b i o \u0254 u (na \u00e1 \u00e2 \u01ce \u00e9 \u00ea \u011b \u025b\u0301 \u025b\u0302 \u025b\u030c \u00ed \u00ee \u01d0 \u00f3 \u00f4 \u01d2 \u0254\u0301 \u0254\u0302 \u0254\u030c \u00fa)\nindagi 28: b c d f g gb h k l m mb mp n nd ng nk ns nt ny nz p r s t v w y z"}
{"id": "4631", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4631", "title": "Inyeyurudu", "text": "Inyeyurudu cyangwa Icyuridu, Icyurudu, Ikiwurudu (izina mu nyeyurudu: \u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648) au la Lashkari (\u0644\u0634\u06a9\u0631\u06cc) ni ururimi rwa Pakisitani na Buhinde. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 urd.\nAlfabeti ya nyeyurudu.\n\u0627 \u0628 \u067e \u062a \u0679 \u062b \u062c \u0686 \u062d \u062e \u062f \u0688 \u0630 \u0631 \u0691 \u0632 \u0698 \u0633 \u0634 \u0635 \u0636 \u0637 \u0638 \u0639 \u063a \u0641 \u0642 \u06a9 \u06af \u0644 \u0645 \u0646 \u0648 \u06be \u06cc \u06d2"}
{"id": "4637", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4637", "title": "Ikimasedoniyani", "text": "Ikimasedoniyani cyangwa Ikimacedoniya na Ikinyamacedoniya (izina mu kimasedoniyani: \"\u043c\u0430\u043a\u0435\u0434\u043e\u043d\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0458\u0430\u0437\u0438\u043a\") ni ururimi rwa Masedoniya ya Ruguru, Alubaniya, Buligariya, Ubugereki, Seribiya na Romaniya. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 mkd.\nAlfabeti y\u2019ikimasedoniyani.\nIkimasedoniyani kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 31: \u0430 \u0431 \u0432 \u0433 \u0434 \u0453 \u0435 \u0436 \u0437 \u0455 \u0438 \u0458 \u043a \u043b \u0459 \u043c \u043d \u045a \u043e \u043f \u0440 \u0441 \u0442 \u045c \u0443 \u0444 \u0445 \u0446 \u0447 \u045f \u0448\ninyajwi 5: \u0430 \u0435 \u0438 \u043e \u0443\nindagi 26: \u0431 \u0432 \u0433 \u0434 \u0453 \u0436 \u0437 \u0455 \u0458 \u043a \u043b \u0459 \u043c \u043d \u045a \u043f \u0440 \u0441 \u0442 \u045c \u0444 \u0445 \u0446 \u0447 \u045f \u0448"}
{"id": "4645", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4645", "title": "Igihongiriya", "text": "Igihongiriya cyangwa Igihonguruwa n\u2019Ikinyahangariya (izina mu gihongiriya: \"magyar nyelv\") ni ururimi rw\u2019Hongiriya, Seribiya, Romaniya, Silovakiya n\u2019Ikerene. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 hun.\nAlfabeti y\u2019igihongiriya.\nIgihongiriya kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 40: a \u00e1 b c cs d dz dzs e \u00e9 f g gy h i \u00ed j k l ly m n ny o \u00f3 \u00f6 \u0151 p r s sz t ty u \u00fa \u00fc \u0171 v z zs\ninyajwi 7: a e i o \u00f6 u \u00fc (na \u00e1 \u00e9 \u00ed \u00f3 \u0151 \u00fa \u0171)\nindagi 26: b c cs d dz dzs f g gy h j k l ly m n ny p r s sz t ty v z zs\ns = sh\nsz = s"}
