{"id": "4819", "revid": "8248", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4819", "title": "Igisansikiriti", "text": "Igisansikiriti (izina mu igisansikiriti: \u0938\u0902\u0938\u094d\u0915\u0943\u0924\u092e\u094d \"sa\u1e43sk\u1e5btam\") ni ururimi kera zo mu \"Greater India\" na i Uttarakhand rw\u2019u Buhinde. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 san.\nAlfabeti ya igisansikiriti.\n\u0905 \u0907 \u0909 \u090b \u090c \u090f \u0913 \u0915 \u0916 \u0917 \u0918 \u0919 \u0939 \u091a \u091b \u091c \u091d \u091e \u092f \u0936 \u091f \u0920 \u0921 \u0922 \u0923 \u0930 \u0937 \u0924 \u0925 \u0926 \u0927 \u0928 \u0932 \u0938 \u092a \u092b \u092c \u092d \u092e \u0935"}
{"id": "4823", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4823", "title": "Igitajiki", "text": "Igitajiki Kinyaperisi cyangwa Igitajika (izina mu gitajiki: \"\u0442\u043e\u04b7\u0438\u043a\u04e3\" cyangwa \"\u0437\u0430\u0431\u043e\u043d\u0438 \u0442\u043e\u04b7\u0438\u043a\u04e3\") ni ururimi rwa Tajikisitani. Itegekongenga ISO 639-3 tgk.\nAlfabeti y\u2019igitajiki.\nIgitajiki kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 39: \u0430 \u0431 \u0432 \u0433 \u0434 \u0435 \u0451 \u0436 \u0437 \u0438 \u0439 \u043a \u043b \u043c \u043d \u043e \u043f \u0440 \u0441 \u0442 \u0443 \u0444 \u0445 \u0446 \u0447 \u0448 \u0449 \u044a \u044b \u044c \u044d \u044e \u044f \u0493 \u04e3 \u049b \u04ef \u04b3 \u04b7 \numugereka \u2013 ubuke.\n-\u04b3\u043e cyangwa -(\u0433)\u043e\u043d:"}
{"id": "4828", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=4828", "title": "Ikibulugariya", "text": "Ikibulugariya cyangwa Ikinyabulugariya, nanone cyitwa Ikibuligare (mu kibulugariya: \"\u0431\u044a\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0435\u0437\u0438\u043a\", \"b\u0103lgarski ezik\"), ni ururimi rw\u2019ikinyasilave cyo mu majyepfo ruvugwa cyane cyane muri Bulugariya, aho ari rwo rurimi rwemewe n\u2019amategeko. Ni kimwe mu ndimi zemewe z\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Uburayi kuva mu 2007.\nIkibulugariya cyandikwa mu nyuguti z\u2019ikinyakirilike. Gifitanye isano rya hafi n\u2019ikimasedoniyani, kandi gitandukanye n\u2019izindi ndimi nyinshi z\u2019ikinyasilave kuko amazina yacyo adahinduka bitewe n\u2019umwanya afite mu nteruro, kandi kigashyira akabimburizina (\"article\") inyuma y\u2019izina.\nIzina.\nMu kinyarwanda, ururimi rwitwa \"Ikibulugariya\" (izina rikoreshwa na Google), \"Ikinyabulugariya\" cyangwa \"Ikibuligare\". Kode yarwo muri ISO 639-1 ni bg, muri ISO 639-3 ni bul.\nAbaruvuga n\u2019aho ruvugwa.\nIkibulugariya kivugwa n\u2019abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 8 ku isi. Itegeko Nshinga rya Bulugariya (ingingo ya 3) rivuga ko ikibulugariya ari rwo rurimi rwemewe rw\u2019igihugu. Kuva Bulugariya yinjira mu Muryango w\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Uburayi ku wa 1 Mutarama 2007, ikibulugariya cyabaye rumwe mu ndimi zemewe z\u2019uwo muryango, n\u2019inyuguti z\u2019ikinyakirilike ziba izemewe zawo.\nHanze ya Bulugariya, ikibulugariya kivugwa n\u2019amatsinda y\u2019Abanyabulugariya batuye mu Ikerene, Molidova, Seribiya, Romaniya, Turukiya n\u2019Ubugereki.\nAmateka.\nIkibulugariya cya kera (\"Old Bulgarian\") ni rwo rurimi rw\u2019ikinyasilave rwa mbere rwanditswe, mu kinyejana cya 9, ku ngoma ya mbere ya Bulugariya. Kizwi kandi ku izina rya \"Old Church Slavonic\", ururimi rw\u2019iyobokamana rw\u2019Abasilave. Inyuguti z\u2019ikinyakirilike zahanzwe muri icyo gihe n\u2019abigishwa ba Siriri na Metodiyo mu mashuri ya Preslav na Ohrid.\nIkibonezamvugo.\nIkibulugariya n\u2019ikimasedoniyani ni zo ndimi zonyine z\u2019ikinyasilave zitagihindura amazina bitewe n\u2019umwanya afite mu nteruro (nta \"cas\" zikigira). Akabimburizina gashyirwa nk\u2019umugereka inyuma y\u2019izina: urugero, \"\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0434\" (umujyi) \u2192 \"\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0434\u044a\u0442\" (umujyi uwo).\nAlfabeti y\u2019ikibulugariya.\nIkibulugariya kigizwe n\u2019inyuguti 30 z\u2019ikinyakirilike. Imbonerahamwe ikurikira yerekana buri nyuguti n\u2019uko yandikwa mu nyuguti z\u2019ikilatini:"}
