{"id": "5759", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5759", "title": "G\u00f6lba\u015f\u0131 (Ankara)", "text": "Akarere ka G\u00f6lba\u015f\u0131 (izina mu giturukiya: \"G\u00f6lba\u015f\u0131 il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Ankara y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere ka G\u00f6lba\u015f\u0131 ni kamwe mu turere 16 tugize Intara y\u2019Ankara. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 85.499 (abagabo 44.008 n\u2019abagore 41.491), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 738,30.\nIzina.\nIryo zina ryakomotse ku magambo 2 yo m\u2019ururimi rw\u2019igiturukiya ariyo (\u00abg\u00f6l\u00bb 'ikiyaga' na \u00abba\u015f\u0131\u00bb &lt; \u00abba\u015f\u00bb 'umutwe'). \nAkarere gahana imbibe.\nGahana imbibi na:\nMu majyaruguru: Akarere ka Yenimahalle n\u2019Akarere ka \u00c7ankaya\nMu burasirazuba: Akarere ka Bal\u00e2\nMu majyepfo: Akarere ka Haymana\nMu burengerazuba: Akarere ka Haymana n\u2019Akarere ka Polatl\u0131\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: Ra\u015fit Zengin\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Yakup Odaba\u015f\u0131"}
{"id": "5761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5761", "title": "Bal\u00e2", "text": "Akarere ka Bal\u00e2 (izina mu giturukiya: \"Bal\u00e2 il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Ankara y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere ka Bal\u00e2 ni kamwe mu turere 16 tugize Intara y\u2019Ankara. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 29.239 (abagabo 14.749 n\u2019abagore 14.490), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 2.830.\nAkarere gahana imbibe.\nGahana imbibi na:\nMu majyaruguru: Akarere ka \u00c7ankaya, Akarere ka Mamak n\u2019Akarere k\u2019Elmada\u011f\nMu burasirazuba: Intara ya K\u0131r\u0131kkale n\u2019Intara ya K\u0131r\u015fehir\nMu majyepfo: Akarere ka \u015eerefliko\u00e7hisar n\u2019Intara ya Konya\nMu burengerazuba: Akarere ka Haymana n\u2019Akarere ka G\u00f6lba\u015f\u0131\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: G\u00fcnay \u00d6zt\u00fcrk\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: \u0130brahim G\u00fcrb\u00fcz"}
{"id": "5763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5763", "title": "\u015eerefliko\u00e7hisar", "text": "Akarere ka \u015eerefliko\u00e7hisar (soma \"shereflikochisar\"; izina mu giturukiya: \"\u015eerefliko\u00e7hisar il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Ankara y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere ka \u015eerefliko\u00e7hisar ni kamwe mu turere 16 tugize Intara y\u2019Ankara. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 35.353 (abagabo 17.643 n\u2019abagore 17.710), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 2.034.\nAkarere gahana imbibe.\nGahana imbibi na:\nMu majyaruguru: Akarere ka Bal\u00e2 \nMu burasirazuba: Akarere k\u2019Evren, Intara ya K\u0131r\u015fehir n\u2019Intara y\u2019Aksaray\nMu majyepfo: Ikiyaga cya Tuz n\u2019Intara y\u2019Aksaray\nMu burengerazuba: Ikiyaga cya Tuz n\u2019Intara ya Konya\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: E. Rumi Y\u0131ld\u0131z\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Ramazan Ceylan"}
{"id": "5765", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5765", "title": "Haymana", "text": "Akarere ka Haymana (izina mu giturukiya: \"Haymana il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Ankara y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere ka Haymana ni kamwe mu turere 16 tugize Intara y\u2019Ankara. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 14.136 (abagabo 6.979 n\u2019abagore 7.157), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 2983,56.\nAkarere gahana imbibe.\nGahana imbibi na:\nMu majyaruguru: Akarere ka Polatl\u0131 n\u2019Akarere ka G\u00f6lba\u015f\u0131\nMu burasirazuba: Akarere ka G\u00f6lba\u015f\u0131 n\u2019Akarere ka Bal\u00e2\nMu majyepfo: Intara ya Konya\nMu burengerazuba: Akarere ka Polatl\u0131\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: S\u00fcleyman Erdo\u011fan\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Hac\u0131 Aysu"}
{"id": "5770", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5770", "title": "Ihene y\u2019Ankara", "text": "Ihene y\u2019Ankara (izina mu giturukiya: \"Ankara ke\u00e7isi\" cyangwa \"tiftik ke\u00e7isi\" ; izina mu cyongereza \"Angora goat\") ni itungo (ubwoko bw\u2019ihene) i Ankara muri Turukiya."}
{"id": "5772", "revid": "12135", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5772", "title": "Setariya", "text": "Setariya (izina ry\u2019ubumenyi mu kilatini \"Setaria italica\") ni ikimera. \nIsaba kwitabwaho cyane ibagarirwa ikanafumbirwa. Bitabaye ibyo, urwiri rurayica.\nImirongo 2 itandukanywa na cm 20 kandi ku murongo umwe, akamanyu gatandukanywa n\u2019akandi na cm 20."}
