{"id": "5985", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5985", "title": "Umusave", "text": "Umusave (izina ry'ubumenyi mu kilatini: \"Markhamia lutea\"; mu Cyongereza \"Nile tulip\" cyangwa \"Nile trumpet\") ni igiti cyo mu muryango wa \"Bignoniaceae\", gikomoka muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, harimo no mu Rwanda.\nNi igiti gihora gifite amababi, gikura vuba, kirangwa n'indabo nini z'umuhondo zimeze nk'impanda. Mu Rwanda gikoreshwa cyane mu buhinzi buvanze n'amashyamba: gitanga inkwi, amakara, ibiti byo kubaka n'imishingiro y'ibishyimbo, kandi giterwa ku mbibi z'imirima no hafi y'ingo.\nImiterere.\nUmusave ni igiti gihora gifite amababi, gishobora kurenga metero 10 z'uburebure aho gikomoka, ariko kikagira metero 4 kugeza kuri 5 gusa iyo cyatewe ahandi. Amababi yacyo, afite uburebure bwa santimetero 20 kugeza kuri 30, akunze guteranira ku mitwe y'amashami.\nIndabo zacyo ziteranye ku mitwe y'amashami; zimeze nk'impanda, z'umuhondo, zifite utudomo tw'umutuku n'icunga mu muhogo, kandi zifite uburebure bwa santimetero 5 kugeza kuri 6. Imbuto zacyo ni udusanduku dushobora kugera kuri santimetero 70 z'uburebure, turimo imbuto nyinshi zifite amababa. Gitubururwa hakoreshejwe imbuto. Izina \"Markhamia\" ryahawe mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro Umwongereza Clements Markham (1830\u20131916).\nMu Rwanda.\nUmusave ni igiti kavukire mu Rwanda, kiboneka urugero mu Bugesera no mu ishyamba rya Gishwati. Gikurira ku butumburuke bwa metero 900 kugeza kuri 2 000, ahagwa imvura ya milimetero 800 kugeza kuri 2 000 ku mwaka, kandi gikunda ubutaka bw'ibumba ritukura.\nGikoreshwa cyane mu buhinzi buvanze n'amashyamba (\"agroforesterie\"): giterwa ku mbibi z'imirima, mu mirima imbere, ku nkengero z'ingo nk'uruzitiro ruzima, no ku miringoti irwanya isuri. Gitanga inkwi, amakara, ibiti byo kubaka, imiti, ibyo inzuki zirya n'imishingiro y'ibishyimbo; kandi gitanga igicucu, gitaka, n'amababi yacyo agafumbira ubutaka. Gishobora gukonorwa no gutemwa kikongera kumera.\nUko kibungabunzwe.\nKu rutonde rutukura rwa UICN, umusave ushyirwa mu moko adafite ikibazo cyo kuzimira (\"Least Concern\")."}
