{"id": "6007", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6007", "title": "\u00c7ubuk", "text": "Akarere ka \u00c7ubuk (soma \u00abcubuk\u00bb ; izina mu giturukiya: \"\u00c7ubuk il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Ankara y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere ka \u00c7ubuk ni kamwe mu turere 16 tugize Intara y\u2019Ankara. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 80.123 (abagabo 40.051 n\u2019abagore 40.072), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 1361,60.\nAkarere gahana imbibe.\nGahana imbibi na:\nMu majyaruguru: Intara ya \u00c7ank\u0131r\u0131\nMu burasirazuba: Akarere ka Kalecik \nMu majyepfo: Akarere k\u2019Akyurt n\u2019Akarere ka Pursaklar\nMu burengerazuba: Akarere ka Pursaklar, Akarere ka Kazan n\u2019Akarere ka K\u0131z\u0131lcahamam\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: Meftun Dall\u0131\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Lokman \u00d6zden"}
{"id": "6012", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6012", "title": "Beypazar\u0131", "text": "Akarere ka Beypazar\u0131 (izina mu giturukiya: \"Beypazar\u0131 il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Ankara y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere ka Beypazar\u0131 ni kamwe mu turere 16 tugize Intara y\u2019Ankara. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 46.768 (abagabo 23.058 n\u2019abagore 23.710), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 1814,36.\nAkarere gahana imbibe.\nGahana imbibi na:\nMu majyaruguru: Intara ya Bolu\nMu burasirazuba: Akarere ka \u00c7aml\u0131dere, Akarere ka G\u00fcd\u00fcl n\u2019Akarere k\u2019Aya\u015f\nMu majyepfo: Akarere ka Polatl\u0131\nMu burengerazuba: Akarere ka Nall\u0131han n\u2019Intara y\u2019Eski\u015fehir\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: Mustafa Kaya\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Mehmet Cengiz \u00d6zalp"}
