{"id": "6099", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6099", "title": "Antoinette Batumubwira", "text": "Madamu Antoinette Batumubwira yavutse mu mwaka wa 1956, avukira i Burundi, mu gace kitwa Ngozi. Ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Burundi. Yabaye minisitiri w\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019Amahanga w\u2019i Burundi kuva mu mwaka wa 2005 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2009. Yashakanye n'uwahoze ari minisitiri w\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga Jean-Marie Ngendahayo.\nMu mpera z'umwaka wa 2007, Batum \u0430\u043d\u044b yagizwe umukandida uzasimbura Alpha Oumar Konar\u00e9 nk'umuyobozi wa komisiyo y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika mu matora y\u2019uwo mwanya mu ntangiriro za 2008. Guverinoma yagerageje kubona inkunga y'ibindi bihugu by'Afurika kugira ngo yiyamamaze, kandi ibihugu byo muri Afurika y'Ibiyaga Bigari byiyemeje ko bizamushyigikira; ariko, nyuma guverinoma yakuyeho kandidatire ye kandi ishyigikira Jean Ping wa Gabon. \n= Inyandiko zifashishijwe ="}
