{"id": "6124", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6124", "title": "Kanguka (ikinyamakuru)", "text": "\"Ntukitiranye n'ikinyamakuru Kangura.\"\nKanguka cyari ikinyamakuru cyigenga cyo mu Rwanda. Cyashinzwe n'umunyamakuru Vincent Rwabukwisi. Cyanengaga ubutegetsi bwa Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana.\nIkinyamakuru Kangura cyashinzwe mu 1990 kugira ngo gihangane na Kanguka.\nAmateka.\nMu 1987, Vincent Rwabukwisi yatangije ikinyamakuru cyigenga cyitwaga \"Kazagwa\". Nyuma cyiswe \"Ejo Nzamera Nte\". Mu 1989, cyahawe izina rya Kanguka.\nMbere, Kanguka ntiyandikaga ibya politiki. Mu 1989, yatangiye kunenga politiki ya Leta. Yarwanyaga ivangura rishingiye ku moko n'uturere. Umucuruzi Valens Kajeguhakwa yateye inkunga Kanguka.\nVincent Rwabukwisi.\nMu 1990, Rwabukwisi yafashwe avuye i Nairobi. Yari yagiye kubaza ibibazo umwami Kigeli V Ndahindurwa. Yakatiwe igifungo cy'imyaka 15. Yafunzwe amezi 10, arekurwa muri Nzeri 1991.\nKu wa 11 Mata 1994, Rwabukwisi yarasiwe iwe i Nyamirambo, i Kigali. Yari Umuhutu, ariko yakekwagaho gukorana na FPR Inkotanyi.\nKangura.\nIkinyamakuru \"The New Times\" cyanditse ko Kangura yashinzwe nk'igisubizo kuri Kanguka. Cyanditse ko Hassan Ngeze yahinduye inyuguti za nyuma z'izina Kanguka."}
