{"id": "6134", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6134", "title": "Rwanda Tribune", "text": "Kigali Daily News (izwi kandi nka KDN) ni urubuga rwo kuri internet rwo mu Rwanda rutangaza amakuru atandukanye mu rurimi rw'Icyongereza. Urubuga, rwatangijwe mu 2022, rutangaza inkuru zijyanye n\u2019amakuru y\u2019igihugu, politiki, imibereho, imyidagaduro, siporo ndetse n\u2019inkuru z\u2019abantu.\nIntego.\nIntego ya Kigali Daily News ni \"gukusanya no gusangiza inkuru z\u2019u Rwanda isi yose,\" hifashishijwe itangazamakuru ryihuta kandi riboneka kuri internet."}
{"id": "6143", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6143", "title": "Intara y\u2019Istanbul", "text": "Intara y\u2019Istanbul cyangwa Intara y\u2019\u0130stanbul (izina mu giturukiya: \"\u0130stanbul ili\") n\u2019intara muri Turukiya. Umurwa mukuru w\u2019intara y\u2019Istanbul witwa umujyi wa Istanbul. Intara y\u2019Istanbul gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 12.915.158 (abagabo 6.498.997 n\u2019abagore 6.416.161), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 5343. \nUmuyobozi w\u2019intara: H\u00fcseyin Avni Mutlu\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Kadir Topba\u015f "}
{"id": "6144", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6144", "title": "Adalar", "text": "Akarere k\u2019Adalar (izina mu giturukiya: \"Adalar il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Istanbul y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere k\u2019Adalar ni kamwe mu turere 39 tugize Intara y\u2019Istanbul. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 14.341 (abagabo 7.692 n\u2019abagore 6.649), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 15,85.\nIzina.\nIryo zina ryakomotse ku magambo 2 yo m\u2019ururimi rw\u2019igiturukiya ariyo (\u00abada\u00bb 'ikirwa' na \u00ab-lar\u00bb 'ubuke: ibirwa').\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: Mevl\u00fct Kurban\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Mustafa Farsako\u011flu "}
{"id": "6150", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6150", "title": "Jean Kambanda", "text": "Jean Kambanda (yavutse ku wa 19 Ukwakira 1955) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwanda wabaye Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Guverinoma y'agateganyo kuva ku wa 9 Mata kugeza ku wa 19 Nyakanga 1994, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu 1998 yemeye ibyaha bya jenoside imbere y'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (ICTR), akatirwa igifungo cya burundu. Ni we mukuru wa guverinoma wa mbere wahamijwe icyaha cya jenoside n'urukiko mpuzamahanga.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nKambanda yize ibijyanye n'ubucuruzi n'amabanki, akora igihe kirekire muri Banki y'Abaturage y'u Rwanda (\"Union des banques populaires du Rwanda\"), aho yageze ku mwanya w'umuyobozi. Muri Mata 1994 yari visi-perezida w'ishyaka MDR mu ntara ya Butare.\nMinisitiri w'Intebe.\nNyuma y'iyicwa rya Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana, Kambanda yashyizweho na Komite y'ibibazo (\"Comit\u00e9 de crise\") nka Minisitiri w'Intebe wa Guverinoma y'agateganyo. Ku wa 14 Gicurasi 1994 yavugiye ijambo muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda i Butare, ashishikariza abarimu n'abanyeshuri kwiga gukoresha imbunda no gushyiraho bariyeri ku mihanda yose.\nKu wa 28 Gicurasi 1994, guverinoma ye yagiranye amasezerano na Paul Barril yo gutanga intwaro n'amasasu no guhugura abasirikare.\nUrubanza.\nKambanda yafatiwe muri Kenya muri Nyakanga 1997, ajyanwa gufungirwa i Arusha muri Tanzaniya. Ku wa 1 Gicurasi 1998 yemeye ibyaha byose uko ari bitandatu, birimo jenoside, gucura umugambi wa jenoside, gushishikariza mu ruhame gukora jenoside, ubufatanyacyaha muri jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu.\nKu wa 4 Nzeri 1998 yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu. Muri 2000 yasabye kwisubiraho ku kwemera ibyaha, avuga ko yabihatiwe, ariko ku wa 19 Ukwakira 2000 Urugereko rw'Ubujurire rwa ICTR rwanze ubujurire bwe, rwemeza igihano.\nIgifungo.\nKambanda yafungiwe muri gereza ya Koulikoro muri Mali. Mu Ukwakira 2024, ari muri gereza yo muri Senegali, yatanze ubuhamya hakoreshejwe amashusho mu rubanza rwa Eug\u00e8ne Rwamucyo mu Rukiko rwa Rubanda (\"Cour d'assises\") rw'i Paris; yavuze ko atemera igihano yahawe."}
{"id": "6151", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6151", "title": "Mich\u00e8le Alliot-Marie", "text": "Amateka yamuranze.\nMich\u00e8le Alliot-Marie (10 Nzeri 1946) wari Minisitiri w\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga w\u2019u Bufaransa.Akaba ari bamwe mubagize inteko ishinga amategeko mu bufaransa, zimnwe mu nshingano zagiye iyagize harimo Kuba umuyobozi w'ingabo Kandi ari umugore umwe mubagize ishyaka ry'abanyaburayi \nUbuzima bwe.\nMich\u00e8le Alliot-Marie.\nYavukiya mu gihugu cy'ubufaransa ku italiki ya 10 Nzeri mu mwaka wa 46,Se umubyara ni Bernard Marie wahoze ari umusifuzi w'umupira wa Ruhago mu makipe mpuzamahaitwa nga,Nyina yitwa Renn\u00e9e Leyko akomoka mu gihugu cya Polonye"}
{"id": "6154", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6154", "title": "Arnavutk\u00f6y", "text": "Akarere k\u2019Arnavutk\u00f6y (izina mu giturukiya: \"Arnavutk\u00f6y il\u00e7esi\") ni akarere kari mu ntara y\u2019Istanbul y\u2019igihugu cya Turukiya. Akarere k\u2019Arnavutk\u00f6y ni kamwe mu turere 39 tugize Intara y\u2019Istanbul. Akarere gatuwe n\u2019abaturage bagera kuri 175,871 (abagabo 86.741 n\u2019abagore 81.380), batuye kubuso bwa km\u00b2 506.52.\nIzina.\nIryo zina ryakomotse ku magambo 2 yo m\u2019ururimi rw\u2019igiturukiya ariyo (\u00abArnavut\u00bb 'umuntu w\u2019Alubaniya' na \u00abk\u00f6y\u00bb 'umudugudu').\nAkarere gahana imbibe.\nGahana imbibi na:\nMu majyaruguru: Black Sea\nMu burasirazuba: Akarere k\u2019Ey\u00fcp\nMu majyepfo: Akarere ka Ba\u015fak\u015fehir, Akarere k\u2019Esenyurt n\u2019Akarere ka B\u00fcy\u00fck\u00e7ekmece\nMu burengerazuba: Akarere ka \u00c7atalca\nUmuyobozi w\u2019akarere: H\u00fcrrem Aksoy\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umujyi: Ahmet Ha\u015fim Baltac\u0131"}
