{"id": "6169", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6169", "title": "Denis Sassou Nguesso", "text": "Denis Sassou Nguesso (yavutse ku ya 23 Ugushyingo 1943 i Edou) ni umusirikare akaba n'umunyapolitiki wa Repubulika ya Kongo, Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva mu 1997, nyuma yo kuba yarakiyoboye bwa mbere kuva mu 1979 kugeza mu 1992. Ni umwe mu bayobozi b'ibihugu bamaze igihe kirekire ku butegetsi muri Afurika. Mu gihe cya manda ye ya mbere, yayoboye ishyaka rimwe rya gikomunisiti, Parti congolais du travail (PCT). Mu 1990, yemeye amashyaka menshi, ariko mu 1992 atsindwa amatora ya perezida. Yagarutse ku butegetsi mu 1997, inyeshyamba ze, Cobras, zifashijwe n'ingabo za Angola, zimaze guhirika Perezida Pascal Lissouba mu ntambara y'abenegihugu. Kuva icyo gihe, yatsinze amatora ya 2002, 2009, 2016, 2021 na 2026, kandi mu 2015 yahinduye Itegeko Nshinga kugira ngo ashobore kongera kwiyamamaza. Ubutegetsi bwe bwakunze kuvugwamo ibirego bya ruswa no kunyereza umutungo wa leta.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nSassou Nguesso yavukiye i Edou, umudugudu uri hafi y'Oyo mu majyaruguru ya Kongo, mu bwoko bw'Abambochi. Ni bucura bw'abana ba Julien Nguesso, wari umutware w'abahigi, na \u00c9milienne Mouebara. Yize amashuri abanza i Fort-Rousset (ubu ni Owando), hanyuma mu ishuri nderabarezi rya Dolisie kuva mu 1956 kugeza mu 1960.\nUmwuga wa gisirikare.\nMu 1960, mbere gato y'uko igihugu kibona ubwigenge, Sassou Nguesso yinjiye mu gisirikare. Yahawe imyitozo ya gisirikare muri Aligeriya, hanyuma mu ishuri ry'abasirikare barwanira ku butaka rya Saint-Maixent, mu Ubufaransa. Yabaye umwe mu basirikare bakuru ba mbere b'umutwe w'abasirikare barwanira mu kirere wa mbere w'ingabo za Kongo, washinzwe na Marien Ngouabi mu 1965; nyuma yayoboye uwo mutwe, ingabo n'akarere ka gisirikare ka Brazzaville, hanyuma ishami ry'ubutasi. Yabaye koloneli mu 1978, nyuma aba jenerali mu 1989.\nIntangiriro y'umwuga wa politiki.\nMu 1968, Sassou Nguesso yagize uruhare muri kudeta yahiritse Perezida Alphonse Massamba-D\u00e9bat, ishyira Marien Ngouabi ku butegetsi, maze aba umwe mu bagize Inama y'Igihugu y'Impinduramatwara. Mu Ukuboza 1969, yatorewe kuba umwe mu bagize komite nkuru ya mbere y'ishyaka rishya rya gikomunisiti, Parti congolais du travail (PCT). Ku ya 18 Gicurasi 1973, yagizwe umuyobozi w'umutekano wa leta, hanyuma Minisitiri w'Ingabo n'Umutekano afite imyaka 32.\nKu ya 18 Werurwe 1977, Perezida Ngouabi yarishwe. Komite ya gisirikare ya PCT iyobowe na Sassou Nguesso yahise ifata ubutegetsi; yayoboye igihugu by'agateganyo, mbere yo guha umwanya Jenerali Joachim Yhombi-Opango, akaguma kuba visi-perezida wa mbere wa komite na Minisitiri w'Ingabo.\nManda ya mbere (1979\u20131992).\nKu ya 8 Gashyantare 1979, Sassou Nguesso yagizwe perezida w'agateganyo, hanyuma ku ya 31 Werurwe 1979 yemezwa nk'umuyobozi wa komite nkuru ya PCT na Perezida wa Repubulika. Nubwo yafatwaga nk'uri ku ruhande rw'Ubumwe bw'Abasoviyeti, yagiranye umubano ukomeye n'Ubufaransa, kandi ikigo cy'Abafaransa cya peteroli Elf Aquitaine cyagize uruhare rukomeye mu bucukuzi bwa peteroli ya Kongo. Kuva mu 1986 kugeza mu 1987, yayoboye Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika (OUA).\nMu 1990, yemeye amashyaka menshi, maze mu 1991 Inama y'Igihugu imwambura ububasha bwo kuyobora, akomeza kuba umukuru w'igihugu w'icyubahiro gusa. Mu matora ya perezida yo muri Kanama 1992, yabaye uwa gatatu n'amajwi 17%, ashyigikira Pascal Lissouba watsinze icyiciro cya kabiri.\nIntambara z'abenegihugu no kugaruka ku butegetsi.\nMu Ugushyingo 1993, intambara y'abenegihugu yadutse nyuma y'impaka ku byavuye mu matora y'abadepite, imitwe yitwaje intwaro ishyigikiye Lissouba irwana n'iya Bernard Kol\u00e9las (Ninjas) n'iya Sassou Nguesso (Cobras). Sassou Nguesso yamaze amezi arindwi i Paris mu 1996, agaruka muri Mutarama 1997 kwitegura amatora ya perezida.\nKu ya 5 Kamena 1997, ingabo za leta zagose inzu ye i Brazzaville, bituma intambara ya kabiri y'abenegihugu yaduka hagati y'ingabo za leta n'umutwe we, Cobras. Ku ya 18 Nzeri, ingabo za Angola zinjiye mu ntambara zimushyigikiye, maze mu Ukwakira Lissouba ahunga igihugu; ku ya 25 Ukwakira 1997, Sassou Nguesso yarahiriye kuba Perezida. Yakuyeho Itegeko Nshinga rya 1992, arisimbuza itegeko ryamuhaye ububasha bwinshi. Imirwano yakomeje kugeza ku masezerano y'amahoro yo mu Ukuboza 1999, ishyira iherezo ku ntambara yasize abantu bari hagati ya 8 000 na 10 000 bapfuye n'abagera ku 800 000 bavuye mu byabo.\nPerezida kuva mu 1997.\nMu matora ya perezida yo ku ya 10 Werurwe 2002, umukandida w'ingenzi utavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi akaba yarivanyemo, Sassou Nguesso yatsinze n'amajwi 89,41%. Muri Mutarama 2006, yatorewe kuyobora Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe. Muri Nyakanga 2009, yongeye gutorwa n'amajwi 78,61%, mu gihe abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bari baretse kwitabira amatora.\nMu 2015, yateguye kamarampaka ku Itegeko Nshinga rishya ryamwemereraga kongera kwiyamamaza; ryemejwe n'amajwi 92,96%, ariko abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi bavuga ko ubwitabire bwari buke. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2016 (60%), mu 2021 (88,57%) no mu Werurwe 2026 (94,82%). Mu matora ya 2021, umukandida wa kabiri, Guy-Brice Parfait Kol\u00e9las, yapfuye azize COVID-19 bukeye bw'amatora.\nNk'umuyobozi w'akanama k'Umuryango w'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe gashinzwe ikibazo cya Libiya, yagize uruhare mu gushaka umuti w'icyo kibazo, ndetse muri Ukuboza 2024 asura Tripoli na Benghazi. Yashishikarije guverinoma z'u Rwanda n'iya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kuganira kugira ngo intambara yo mu burasirazuba bwa Kongo irangire. Yateguye kandi inama y'Ibibaya Bitatu (\"Sommet des trois Bassins\") i Brazzaville mu Ukwakira 2023, igamije kurengera amashyamba y'inzitane. Kuva muri Nzeri 2025, ayoboye inama y'abakuru b'ibihugu bya CEMAC.\nIbirego bya ruswa.\nMu Mata 2007, imiryango ya Sherpa na Survie yareze mu Bufaransa abakuru b'ibihugu bitanu b'Afurika n'imiryango yabo, barimo Sassou Nguesso, ibashinja guhisha umutungo wanyerejwe muri leta, mu rubanza ruzwi nka \u00abimitungo yabonetse mu buryo butemewe\u00bb (\"biens mal acquis\"). Mu 2010, Urukiko rusesa imanza rw'Ubufaransa rwemeye ko ikirego gikurikiranwa. Mu Nyakanga 2007, umuryango Global Witness wagaragaje ko umuhungu we, Denis Christel Sassou Nguesso, yaba yarakoresheje amafaranga y'ubucuruzi bwa peteroli mu kugura ibintu by'agaciro i Paris na Dubai.\nMu Ukwakira 2021, izina rye ryagaragaye mu nyandiko zizwi nka \"Pandora Papers\", zavuze ko mu 1998, nyuma gato yo gusubira ku butegetsi, handitswe ikigo cyitwa Inter African Investment mu birwa bya Virginie by'Abongereza, ahantu hazwiho kudasoresha. Guverinoma ye yahakanye uruhare urwo ari rwo rwose muri icyo kibazo. Muri Mutarama 2026, yavuzwe mu kibazo cya ruswa gifitanye isano n'ikigo cya peteroli cyo muri Noruveje, Petronor; guverinoma ye ibyita gusebanya.\nKu butegetsi bwe, ubukungu bwagiye buzamuka, ariko igihugu gifite umwenda munini, kandi abaturage benshi baracyabaho mu bukene nubwo igihugu gikungahaye kuri peteroli n'amabuye y'agaciro.\nUbuzima bwite.\nSassou Nguesso yashakanye na Antoinette Tchibota. Afite abana benshi; umukobwa we, \u00c9dith Lucie, yashakanye na Perezida wa Gabon, Omar Bongo, mu 1989."}
