{"id": "6175", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6175", "title": "Yoweri Museveni", "text": "Yoweri Kaguta Museveni Tibuhaburwa (yavutse ku ya 15 Nzeri 1944 i Ntungamo) ni umusirikare akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Ubugande, Perezida w'icyo gihugu kuva mu 1986. Nyuma yo kurwanya ubutegetsi bw'igitugu bwa Idi Amin, yayoboye umutwe w'inyeshyamba wa National Resistance Army (NRA) mu ntambara yo mu ishyamba yo kurwanya ubutegetsi bwa Milton Obote, maze mu 1986 afata Kampala, aba perezida. Ku butegetsi bwe, Ubugande bwagize iterambere ry'ubukungu, kandi bwahanganye n'inyeshyamba za Lord's Resistance Army; ingabo z'Ubugande zagize uruhare mu ntambara ya mbere n'iya kabiri za Kongo. Kubera ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga ryakuyeho imbibi za manda (2005) n'iz'imyaka (2017\u20132018), yakomeje kongera gutorwa, kugeza ku manda ye ya karindwi mu 2026. Kugeza mu 2026, ni umwe mu bayobozi b'ibihugu bamaze igihe kirekire ku butegetsi ku isi, akaba afatwa n'imiryango myinshi n'itangazamakuru nk'umunyagitugu.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere.\nYoweri Museveni yavutse ku ya 15 Nzeri 1944 i Ntungamo, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'Ubugande, ku babyeyi Amos Kaguta (1916\u20132013), wari umworozi w'inka, na Esteri Kokundeka Nganzi (1918\u20132001). Ni Umuhima wo mu bwami bwa Mpororo (ubu ni igice cya Ankole). Izina rya \u00abMuseveni\u00bb rikomoka ku ijambo ry'Icyongereza \u00ab\"seven\"\u00bb (\u00abkarindwi\u00bb): se yari umusirikare wo muri batayo ya karindwi ya \"King's African Rifles\" mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose.\nAmashuri n'ibikorwa bya mbere bya politiki.\nMuseveni yize mu mashuri ya Kyamate na Mbarara, hanyuma mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Ntare kuva mu 1961. Yize ubukungu n'ubumenyi bwa politiki muri Kaminuza ya Dar es Salaam, muri Tanzaniya, kuva mu 1967 kugeza mu 1970, mu gihe icyo gihugu cyari kiyobowe na Julius Nyerere kandi cyakiraga impirimbanyi nyinshi zirwanya ubukoloni. Yanditse igitabo cy'ubushakashatsi kuri Frantz Fanon, kandi ahamenyanira na John Garang. Muri kaminuza, yashinze kandi ayobora urugaga rw'abanyeshuri b'impinduramatwara b'Abanyafurika (USARF), ayobora itsinda ry'abanyeshuri ryagiye mu bice byari bigenzurwa na FRELIMO muri Mozambike, aho bahawe imyitozo ya gisirikare. Mu 1970, yagarutse mu Bugande, yinjira mu rwego rw'ubutasi ku butegetsi bwa Perezida Milton Obote.\nUrugamba rw'inyeshyamba.\nNyuma ya kudeta ya Idi Amin yo ku ya 25 Mutarama 1971, Museveni yahungiye muri Tanzaniya, ashinga umutwe wa Front for National Salvation (FRONASA). Mu 1979, yagarutse mu Bugande ayoboye inyeshyamba zafashijwe n'ingabo za Tanzaniya, mu ntambara yahiritse Amin, maze aba Minisitiri w'Ingabo.\nIshyaka rye, Uganda Patriotic Movement, ryatsinzwe mu matora ya 1980 yagaruye Obote ku butegetsi, ayo matora akaba yarateje impaka nyinshi. Avuga ko yaranzwe n'uburiganya, Museveni yashinze umutwe w'inyeshyamba wa National Resistance Army (NRA). Ku ya 6 Gashyantare 1981, ari kumwe n'abarwanyi bagera kuri mirongo itatu, barimo Paul Kagame, yigaruriye ububiko bw'intwaro bw'ikigo cya gisirikare cya Kabamba. Yubatse buhoro buhoro umutwe wa politiki wa National Resistance Movement (NRM) n'ingabo zawo, NRA, zabonye inkunga y'abaturage kubera imyitwarire myiza yazo. Ku ya 26 Mutarama 1986, nyuma y'urugamba rwa Kampala, NRA yafashe umurwa mukuru, maze Museveni arahirira kuba perezida.\nPerezida w'Ubugande.\nUbukungu n'imibereho.\nKuva yafata ubutegetsi, Museveni yashyize imbere kugarura amahoro mu gihugu cyari cyarashegeshwe n'intambara no kuzahura ubukungu. Mu 1987, yaretse ibitekerezo bya gikomunisiti, yemera amabwiriza y'Ikigega Mpuzamahanga cy'Imari (FMI) na Banki y'Isi, maze Ubugande bufatwa nk'\u00abumunyeshuri mwiza\u00bb wa FMI. Ubukungu bwazamutseho impuzandengo ya 6,5% ku mwaka mu myaka ya 1990, n'irenga 7% mu myaka ya 2000, kandi ubukene bwagabanutse inshuro eshatu mu myaka makumyabiri. Yashyizeho imyanya yagenewe abagore mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, kandi mu 1997 atangiza amashuri abanza y'ubuntu. Ubugande bwagabanyije cyane ikwirakwira rya SIDA. Kuva mu 1991 kugeza mu 1992, Museveni yayoboye Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika (OUA).\nMu 2006, ubutegetsi bwe bwashyize iherezo ku bikorwa by'inyeshyamba za Lord's Resistance Army mu majyaruguru y'igihugu.\nAkarere k'Ibiyaga Bigari.\nMuseveni yashyigikiye umutwe wa FPR-Inkotanyi w'inshuti ye Paul Kagame, wafashe ubutegetsi mu Rwanda muri Nyakanga 1994, ugahagarika Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Mu ntambara ya mbere ya Kongo (1996\u20131997), u Rwanda n'Ubugande byashyigikiye inyeshyamba za Laurent-D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Kabila zahiritse Mobutu Sese Seko. Muri Kanama 1998, mu ntambara ya kabiri ya Kongo, ingabo z'Ubugande zinjiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kurwanya Kabila, zishyigikira n'inyeshyamba za Jean-Pierre Bemba. Ingabo z'u Rwanda n'iz'Ubugande zashinjwe gusahura umutungo kamere wa Kongo. Mu 2000, ingabo z'ibihugu byombi zarasanye inshuro eshatu i Kisangani, bituma umubano wa Kagame na Museveni uzamba. Ingabo z'Ubugande zavuye muri Kongo mu 2003, maze mu Ukuboza 2005 Urukiko Mpuzamahanga rw'Ubutabera rutegeka Ubugande kwishyura indishyi Kongo kubera ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu ryakozwe muri iyo ntambara.\nAmatora n'ivugurura ry'Itegeko Nshinga.\nMuri Gicurasi 1996, Museveni yatsinze amatora ya mbere ya perezida yari abaye mu myaka 16, n'amajwi 74%, maze mu 2001 yongera gutorwa n'amajwi 69,3%, atsinda Kizza Besigye. Muri Nyakanga 2005, Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yavuguruye Itegeko Nshinga kugira ngo ashobore kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu; muri uwo mwaka, kamarampaka yongeye kwemerera amashyaka gukora, nyuma y'uko yari yarabujijwe kuva mu 1986. Yongeye gutorwa mu 2006 (60%), mu 2011 (68%) no mu 2016 (60,75%), buri gihe atsinda Kizza Besigye. Mu 2018, yasinye itegeko rikuraho imbibi z'imyaka 75 ku mukandida ku mwanya wa perezida.\nMu matora yo ku ya 14 Mutarama 2021, yatsinze umuhanzi akaba n'umunyapolitiki Bobi Wine n'amajwi 58,6%, nubwo habayeho ibirego by'uburiganya n'ihohoterwa ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu ; yarahiriye manda ya gatandatu ku ya 12 Gicurasi 2021. Mu matora ya Mutarama 2026, yongeye gutorwa n'amajwi 71,65%, imbere ya Bobi Wine (24,72%), mu bihe byaranzwe n'ifatwa n'ishimutwa ry'abatavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, ihagarikwa rya interineti n'urugomo. Bobi Wine yamaganye ibyavuye muri ayo matora. Museveni yarahiriye manda ya karindwi ku ya 12 Gicurasi 2026.\nItegeko rihana ubutinganyi.\nMuri Gashyantare 2014, Museveni yasinye itegeko rikaza ibihano ku butinganyi; Urukiko rurinda Itegeko Nshinga rwaritesheje agaciro muri Kanama 2014. Ubutegetsi bwe bwakomeje gushyiraho ingamba zikaze zirwanya abaryamana bahuje ibitsina.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1973, Museveni yashakanye na Janet Museveni, na we wabaye umunyapolitiki; bafitanye abana bane, barimo Muhoozi Kainerugaba, jenerali mu ngabo z'Ubugande. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2000, yabaye umuyoboke w'Itorero ry'Abapentekote. Yanditse igitabo cy'ubuzima bwe, \"Sowing the Mustard Seed\" (1997)."}
