{"id": "6206", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6206", "title": "Agnes van Ardenne", "text": "Anna Maria Agnes \"Agnes\" van Ardenne-Van der Hoeven (wavutse ku wa 21 Mutarama 1950) ni umunyapolitiki n'umudipolomate w'Umuholandi wagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru. Yabaye umwe mu banyamuryango b'ishyaka Christian Democratic Appeal (CDA), aho yagiye anagira imyanya itandukanye muri guverinoma y'u Buholandi ndetse no mu rwego rwa dipolomasi.\nUmwuga.\nAgnes van Ardenne yavukiye i Maasland mu Buholandi ku wa 21 Mutarama 1950. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Guverinoma y'u Buholandi, yabaye Visi Perezida w'umuryango CORDAID, ukora ibikorwa by'ubutabazi n'iterambere, ndetse aba n'Umunyamabanga Mukuru wa Komite y'igihugu ya UNICEF mu Buholandi.Hagati ya 1994 na 2002, yari umwe mu bagize Inteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Buholandi. Muri icyo gihe kandi yari mu ntumwa z'Inteko zoherezwaga mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'Inama y'u Burayi (PACE).\nMinisitiri ushinzwe ubufatanye mu iterambere.\nKuva mu 2002 kugeza mu 2007, Agnes van Ardenne yabaye Minisitiri ushinzwe Ubutwererane Mpuzamahanga n'Iterambere muri guverinoma ya Minisitiri w'Intebe Jan Peter Balkenende. Mu mwaka wa 2004, ubwo u Buholandi bwari buyoboye Inama y'Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'u Burayi, yayoboye inama z'abaminisitiri bashinzwe ubufatanye mu iterambere.Mu gihe yari kuri uwo mwanya, yibanze ku gufasha ibihugu bifite intege nke n'ibyugarijwe n'intambara, harimo na Sudani. Yanashyize imbere ko nibura 50% by'ingengo y'imari y'u Buholandi yagenerwaga ubufatanye bw'ibihugu byombi ishyirwa mu mishinga yo muri Afurika.\nMu 2006, yahagaritse inkunga y'amadolari ya Amerika agera kuri miliyoni 150 yagombaga guhabwa guverinoma ya Perezida Mwai Kibaki wa Kenya, bitewe n'impungenge zerekeye ruswa.Nyuma y'umutingito wabaye muri Kashmir mu mwaka wa 2005, yabaye umwe mu bayobozi ba mbere baturutse mu mahanga basuye Pakisitani kugira ngo barebe uko ibikorwa by'ubutabazi byakorwaga.\nGushyigikira uburezi n'ubuzima.\nMu 2006, yongereye inkunga u Buholandi bwatangaga mu burezi bwo mu mashuri yisumbuye na kaminuza, ayigeza kuri miliyoni 110 z'amayero ku mwaka. Yanongereye kandi umusanzu watangwaga muri gahunda ya Education for All Fast Track Initiative (FTI) awugeza kuri miliyoni 150 z'amayero.Muri uwo mwaka kandi, yasezeranyije GAVI inkunga igera kuri miliyoni 100 z'amayero mu myaka ine yo gushyigikira gahunda zo gukingira abana no guteza imbere ubuvuzi. Yanatanze indi nkunga ya miliyoni 201 z'amadolari ya Amerika kuri UNICEF, igamije gufasha abana bibasiwe n'intambara, ibiza cyangwa ibindi bibazo gukomeza amashuri.\nNyuma yo kuva muri guverinoma.\nNyuma yo kuva muri guverinoma mu 2007, yabaye Uhagarariye u Buholandi muri FAO, WFP na IFAD i Roma kugeza mu 2011.Hagati ya 2011 na 2014, yabaye Perezida w'Inama y'Ubuhinzi bw'Indabo n'Ibihingwa by'Ubusitani mu Buholandi. Kuva mu 2017, ni Perezida w'Ikigo cy'u Buholandi gishinzwe igenzura ry'ubuhinzi bw'indabo n'ibihingwa by'ubusitani.\nIbindi bikorwa.\nMu miryango mpuzamahanga.\nHagati ya 2003 na 2007, Agnes van Ardenne yabaye umwe mu bagize Inama y'Abaguverineri mu mwanya w'uhagarariye u Buholandi mu Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere (AfDB), Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere ya Aziya (ADB) ndetse no muri Banki y'Isi (World Bank).\nMu miryango idaharanira inyungu.\nKuva mu 2013, ni Perezida w'Inama y'Ubutegetsi y'African Studies Centre (ASC) yo muri Kaminuza ya Leiden, ikigo gikora ubushakashatsi ku Afurika.Kuva mu 2012, yabaye umwe mu bagize Inama Ngishwanama y'Ubuzima bw'Ibidukikije n'Ibikorwaremezo (RLI) mu Buholandi.Yanabaye Perezida w'Inama y'Ubugenzuzi ya Van Hall Larenstein, ishuri rikuru ryigisha ibijyanye n'ubuhinzi, ibidukikije n'iterambere rirambye. Ni na we uyoboye Inama y'Ubutegetsi y'Marga Klomp\u00e9 Foundation, umuryango ukora ibikorwa by'imibereho myiza n'iterambere ry'abaturage.\nImya ya politiki.\nKu wa 30 Werurwe 2012, Agnes van Ardenne hamwe n'abandi banyapolitiki bakomeye bo mu ishyaka Christian Democratic Appeal (CDA), barimo ba Minisitiri b'Intebe bahoze ari bo Ruud Lubbers na Piet de Jong, bashyize umukono ku nyandiko yamaganaga icyemezo cya guverinoma ya Minisitiri w'Intebe Mark Rutte cyo kugabanya ingengo y'imari yagenerwaga ubufatanye mpuzamahanga n'iterambere."}
{"id": "6210", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6210", "title": "Antipas Mbusa Nyamwisi", "text": "Bwana Antipas Mbusa Nyamwisi (15 Ugushyingo 1959) ni Minisitiri w\u2019Ubutwererane bw\u2019Akarere muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Muri Werurwe 2023, Antipas Mbusa aba umunyamabanga wa Leta, ushinzwe kwishyira hamwe kw'akarere."}
